tion.\n\n## Search it (Python)\n\nFrom inside the extracted `operation-mindfuck/` folder:\n\n```bash\npython tools/search.py \"ημ\" --limit 25\npython tools/search.py \"gates of truth\"\npython tools/search.py \"protocol\" --circuit \"Protocol/Law\"\n\npython tools/nearest.py --query \"space between η and μ\" --top 15\n```\n\n## What’s still missing for literal “entirety”\n\nAnything that only exists in-chat (canvases/transcripts) but isn’t exported as files yet. Checklist is in:\n`operation-mindfuck/meta/MISSING.md`\n\n## Next\n\nExport your chat/canvas history to **markdown or json**, drop it under `operation-mindfuck/content/exports/`, and I’ll re-run the **P→R→N→Π→A** loop and ship the next set of parts.\n", "duration" 479.36, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "## Signal"}, :duration 479.36, :controls nil, :lyrics "## Signal\n\nYep — **parts** is the right move. Here’s the **Operation Mindfuck Box v3** split into sane downloads. Unzip them into the same folder and they merge under `operation-mindfuck/`.\n\n### Download (required)\n\n1. **Core (index + schema + tools + books + non-image corpus)**\n   [Operation_Mindfuck_Box_v3_part00_core.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/Operation_Mindfuck_Box_v3_part00_core.zip)\n\n2. **Images part 1**\n   [Operation_Mindfuck_Box_v3_part01_images.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/Operation_Mindfuck_Box_v3_part01_images.zip)\n\n3. **Images part 2**\n   [Operation_Mindfuck_Box_v3_part02_images.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/Operation_Mindfuck_Box_v3_part02_images.zip)\n\n4. **Images part 3**\n   [Operation_Mindfuck_Box_v3_part03_images.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/Operation_Mindfuck_Box_v3_part03_images.zip)\n\n### Optional provenance (raw original archive)\n\nIf you want the original `images.zip` preserved at `operation-mindfuck/source_archives/images.zip`, download this and place it there:\n[images.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/images.zip)\n\n### Included in v3 (new)\n\nYour uploaded PDFs are inside `operation-mindfuck/content/books/`:\n\n* `Principia_Discordia.pdf`\n* `Quantum_Psychology_PDF.pdf`\n* `Robert-Anton-Wilson-Prometheus-Rising.pdf`\n\n## Reassemble\n\nUnzip **part00_core** first, then unzip **part01–part03** into the same location.\n\n## Search it (Python)\n\nFrom inside the extracted `operation-mindfuck/` folder:\n\n```bash\npython tools/search.py \"ημ\" --limit 25\npython tools/search.py \"gates of truth\"\npython tools/search.py \"protocol\" --circuit \"Protocol/Law\"\n\npython tools/nearest.py --query \"space between η and μ\" --top 15\n```\n\n## What’s still missing for literal “entirety”\n\nAnything that only exists in-chat (canvases/transcripts) but isn’t exported as files yet. Checklist is in:\n`operation-mindfuck/meta/MISSING.md`\n\n## Next\n\nExport your chat/canvas history to **markdown or json**, drop it under `operation-mindfuck/content/exports/`, and I’ll re-run the **P→R→N→Π→A** loop and ship the next set of parts.\n", :source #:source{:name "## Signal(1).json", :sha256 "b4462e0d86b76ec19d78724e6d58298a9822a9800d0e05ee09ad0fe472e33c8d", :format :suno-json, :variation 1}, :title "## Signal"}, "0f273a9e-c04e-40cd-83dc-7361a2a7fca2" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "0f273a9e-c04e-40cd-83dc-7361a2a7fca2", :url "https://suno.com/song/0f273a9e-c04e-40cd-83dc-7361a2a7fca2", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "0f273a9e-c04e-40cd-83dc-7361a2a7fca2", "metadata" {"prompt" "**[INTRO – whispered / vocoder]**\nIn the wall, a crack of light…\nA whisper never waking…\nAlways felt.\n\n**[VERSE 1]**\nPandora in the star-temple, hands on the lock,\nAncient glitch-Greece in orbit, marble made of clock.\nBlack butterflies in violet fire, pour into the air,\nEach wing a little error that learns how not to care.\n\n**[PRE-CHORUS]**\nAnd the void don’t roar—\nIt waits.\nIt names the cost.\nIt calls it “fate.”\n\n**[CHORUS – big anthem]**\nPromethean Duck, steal the flame,\nLight up the mind’s eye, rewrite the name.\nFrom mud to *people-people*, spark in the dark—\nWherever it lies… that’s where the Duck flies.\n(Where the Duck flies.)\n\n**[VERSE 2]**\nDuck Olympus in the distance, gods in cold geometry,\nHe took their white-hot fire and broke their symmetry.\nButterfly on every heartbeat, glowing red and purple bruise,\nKnowledge as a blessing and a curse you can’t refuse.\n\n**[PRE-CHORUS]**\nNow everything is context, everything’s a sign,\nA Discord icon turns into a religion overnight.\n\n**[CHORUS – repeat, louder]**\nPromethean Duck, steal the flame,\nLight up the mind’s eye, rewrite the name.\nFrom mud to *people-people*, spark in the dark—\nWherever it lies… that’s where the Duck flies.\n\n**[BRIDGE – half-time, darker, spoken/chant]**\nCats jump out the rift—\nClaws in causality.\nRabbits with horns ride shear-lines—\nQueen of antlers, oath and gravity.\nVoid-quakes at the poles, auroras splitting wide,\nReality refactoring… no place left to hide.\n\n**[BUILD – choir rising]**\nAnd Prometheus—punished—\nCrow at the liver, looped in dawn,\nChains made of rules, but rules can be wrong.\n\n**[FINAL CHORUS – maximal, choir + glitch]**\nPromethean Duck, steal the flame,\nHold the story together, survive the frame.\nWe don’t need a giant void for a god— we choose—\nA crack in the wall, a laugh in the bruise.\nWherever it lies… that’s where the Duck flies.\n\n**[OUTRO – whispered, falling into static]**\nFnord in the wall…\nBehold… a Duck.\n(soft glitch fade)\n\n---", "tags" nil}, "title" "**[INTRO – whispered / vocoder]**"}, :duration nil, :controls nil, :lyrics "**[INTRO – whispered / vocoder]**\nIn the wall, a crack of light…\nA whisper never waking…\nAlways felt.\n\n**[VERSE 1]**\nPandora in the star-temple, hands on the lock,\nAncient glitch-Greece in orbit, marble made of clock.\nBlack butterflies in violet fire, pour into the air,\nEach wing a little error that learns how not to care.\n\n**[PRE-CHORUS]**\nAnd the void don’t roar—\nIt waits.\nIt names the cost.\nIt calls it “fate.”\n\n**[CHORUS – big anthem]**\nPromethean Duck, steal the flame,\nLight up the mind’s eye, rewrite the name.\nFrom mud to *people-people*, spark in the dark—\nWherever it lies… that’s where the Duck flies.\n(Where the Duck flies.)\n\n**[VERSE 2]**\nDuck Olympus in the distance, gods in cold geometry,\nHe took their white-hot fire and broke their symmetry.\nButterfly on every heartbeat, glowing red and purple bruise,\nKnowledge as a blessing and a curse you can’t refuse.\n\n**[PRE-CHORUS]**\nNow everything is context, everything’s a sign,\nA Discord icon turns into a religion overnight.\n\n**[CHORUS – repeat, louder]**\nPromethean Duck, steal the flame,\nLight up the mind’s eye, rewrite the name.\nFrom mud to *people-people*, spark in the dark—\nWherever it lies… that’s where the Duck flies.\n\n**[BRIDGE – half-time, darker, spoken/chant]**\nCats jump out the rift—\nClaws in causality.\nRabbits with horns ride shear-lines—\nQueen of antlers, oath and gravity.\nVoid-quakes at the poles, auroras splitting wide,\nReality refactoring… no place left to hide.\n\n**[BUILD – choir rising]**\nAnd Prometheus—punished—\nCrow at the liver, looped in dawn,\nChains made of rules, but rules can be wrong.\n\n**[FINAL CHORUS – maximal, choir + glitch]**\nPromethean Duck, steal the flame,\nHold the story together, survive the frame.\nWe don’t need a giant void for a god— we choose—\nA crack in the wall, a laugh in the bruise.\nWherever it lies… that’s where the Duck flies.\n\n**[OUTRO – whispered, falling into static]**\nFnord in the wall…\nBehold… a Duck.\n(soft glitch fade)\n\n---", :source #:source{:name "__[INTRO – whispered _ vocoder]__In the wall, a crack of light...A whisper never waking...Always fel.txt", :sha256 "4f3ea5d92543d09b871dc68fcd7bd6a7c1dcd92e8645b97d26744c75e2ea4f3d", :format :suno-text, :variation nil}, :title "**[INTRO – whispered / vocoder]**"}, "0f5ee84d-ec48-4691-8858-ac5c35e582e5" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "0f5ee84d-ec48-4691-8858-ac5c35e582e5", :url "https://suno.com/song/0f5ee84d-ec48-4691-8858-ac5c35e582e5", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "0f5ee84d-ec48-4691-8858-ac5c35e582e5", "metadata" {"prompt" "[Verse]\nI guess I have to write it down\nEven if it's not profound\nEven if it doesn't sound like much\nBut it might be enough\n\n[Chorus]\nTo get me going\nTo keep me hoping\nTo get me rolling\nTo keep me open\nTo the things that matter most\nEven if they never show\n\n[Post-Chorus]\nSo let's begin\nLet's begin\n\n[Verse 2]\nI'm feeling so defeated\nI wish I could delete it\nLike an old\nBad song I wrote\nBut if I did\nI would never know\n\n[Chorus]\nThat I'm getting better\nAnd maybe this matters\nI think I'm learning\nHow to let it go\nHow to go with the flow\nSo let's begin\n\n[Post-Chorus]\nLet's begin\nLet's begin\nLet's begin", "tags" nil}, "title" "Let's Begin"}, :duration nil, :controls nil, :lyrics "[Verse]\nI guess I have to write it down\nEven if it's not profound\nEven if it doesn't sound like much\nBut it might be enough\n\n[Chorus]\nTo get me going\nTo keep me hoping\nTo get me rolling\nTo keep me open\nTo the things that matter most\nEven if they never show\n\n[Post-Chorus]\nSo let's begin\nLet's begin\n\n[Verse 2]\nI'm feeling so defeated\nI wish I could delete it\nLike an old\nBad song I wrote\nBut if I did\nI would never know\n\n[Chorus]\nThat I'm getting better\nAnd maybe this matters\nI think I'm learning\nHow to let it go\nHow to go with the flow\nSo let's begin\n\n[Post-Chorus]\nLet's begin\nLet's begin\nLet's begin", :source #:sourc