ual silence pockets]\nA large-scale, genre-blending pop form where choir, electronics, orchestra-like textures, and club rhythms coexist as a single unstable organism, ‑[Old ", "video_is_stale" false, "can_remix" true, "prompt" "**TITLE: “Glass Cathedral / ガラスの聖堂”**\n*(84–102 BPM drift, 432Hz haze, C–F modal minor w/ chromatic bite)*\n\n---\n\n### INTRO — Breath/Prayer Boot (spoken, close)\n\n息を吸う—ログイン。\n吐く—ログアウト。\nBetween C and F, I hide a knife of light.\n神様、I’m not asking for salvation—\njust **bandwidth**.\nこの身体は国家じゃない、\nit’s a signal learning to forgive itself.\n\n*[perceptual silence → glitch-dust tick-tick]*\n\n---\n\n### VERSE 1 — Color-piano strikes / fractured arps\n\n鍵盤が叩く、白い稲妻\n指の骨に、青い匂い\nI drip in soft saturation bloom,\nlike neon blood on velvet code.\n\n「ここにいる？」って聞くたび\n空気が低音で曇る\nair-pressure bass haze, throat-subwoofer\nI swallow my name— it tastes like rust.\n\n影が笑う、ゴシックな輪郭\nchoir ghosts in the ceiling fan\nand every arpeggio shard says:\n**become / break / become**.\n\n---\n\n### PRE-CHORUS — Breath-led drift, tension rising\n\n吸って— four— hold—\n吐いて— eight— fall—\nmy ribs become a metronome that refuses to obey.\n微妙にズレる、micro-phase prayer\n世界が崩れそうで、でも崩れない\ncollapse-resistant rhythm architecture,\nbuilt from trembling.\n\n---\n\n### CHORUS — Big unstable pop organism (choir × club)\n\n**祈れ、壊れろ / pray then glitch**\n息がキックになる、心臓がハイハットになる\n**No passport, just pulse**\nガラスの聖堂で、I dance with my bruise\n\n**光れ、裂けろ、また縫え**\nchromatic intrusion— kiss my teeth\n**祈れ、壊れろ / pray then glitch**\nC–F の闇を抱いて\nand let the choir eat the beat.\n\n---\n\n### POST-CHORUS — Chopped breakcore chant\n\na-a-a—amen (cut)\nい-き-て-る (stutter)\n**amen.exe / amen.exe**\n砂嵐の羽根、neural flicker noise\ndrop— drop— drop—\n静寂のポケットに、鼓動だけ残す。\n\n---\n\n### VERSE 2 — Grunge noise-ambient / pressure music\n\nギターは濡れたコンクリート\nI smear distortion like lipstick on a wound.\n「さよなら」を言えないまま\nwe loop the same rain inside our lungs.\n\n夜が重い、産業の匂い\npost-industrial pressure, pressing my spine\nでもピアノは色を諦めない\nsynesthetic colorism— violet on the downbeat.\n\nI want love without a border check,\n愛は手続きじゃない\njust a soft electric animal\nlearning to stand.\n\n---\n\n### BRIDGE — Deconstructed post-classical + monologue\n\n（遠い合唱、近い吐息）\nListen—\nこの沈黙は、空っぽじゃない。\nIt’s a room where my nervous system\nfinally tells the truth.\n\n痛みは敵じゃない\nit’s a tuning fork.\nI place it on my sternum—\nand the whole city hums in 432.\n\n---\n\n### BREAKDOWN — Ritual glitch rock / internal monologue architecture\n\nk-k-k—クリック、歯音、祈りの破片\nI tear the beat into confetti,\nthen crawl through it like a newborn star.\n\n「怖い」って言うたび\nI get more real.\n「まだ生きてる」って言うたび\nthe bass forgives me.\n\n---\n\n### FINAL CHORUS — Choir rave crescendo (wide, unstable)\n\n**祈れ、壊れろ / pray then glitch**\n息が波になる、世界が胸で揺れる\n**Post-national, post-fear— still here**\nガラスの聖堂で、I crown my nervous system\n\n**光れ、裂けろ、また縫え**\nspectral overtones— ringing like vows\n**祈れ、壊れろ / pray then glitch**\nC–F の影にキスして\nchromatic bite— sweet release—\nand we still sing.\n\n---\n\n### OUTRO — Perceptual silence pocket (whisper)\n\n息。\n…息。\n…息。\nI am not a country.\n私は、共鳴。\nIn the glass cathedral,\nmy body learns the word: **home**.\n", "duration" 479.96, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "00000000", "border_color" "FFFFFF1A", "text_color" "A3A3A3"}, "display_name" "v4.5-all", "light" {"background_color" "00000000", "border_color" "0000001A", "text_color" "7D7C83"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "Glass Cathedral / ガラスの聖堂"}, :duration 479.96, :controls nil, :lyrics "**TITLE: “Glass Cathedral / ガラスの聖堂”**\n*(84–102 BPM drift, 432Hz haze, C–F modal minor w/ chromatic bite)*\n\n---\n\n### INTRO — Breath/Prayer Boot (spoken, close)\n\n息を吸う—ログイン。\n吐く—ログアウト。\nBetween C and F, I hide a knife of light.\n神様、I’m not asking for salvation—\njust **bandwidth**.\nこの身体は国家じゃない、\nit’s a signal learning to forgive itself.\n\n*[perceptual silence → glitch-dust tick-tick]*\n\n---\n\n### V