ntent_compression_spec.md`\n\n## Why this is safe\n\nAdditive + versioned: it doesn’t overwrite your story corpus, only adds a new analysis lane (`gates_of_truth_intent_dense`) and a new optional build flag.\n\n## Frames\n\n1. **Intent as signal compression:** keep it dense enough to stream through cephalon loops.\n2. **Intent as fork fuel:** forks only happen where intent-energy crosses gates.\n3. **Intent as audit object:** binary for speed; anchors for truth.\n\n## Countermoves\n\n* If an intent event can’t be anchored → treat it as **invalid output** (drop it / fail build next pass).\n* If intent feels “over-saturated” (too many 255s) → adjust the strength curve in the analyzer (still stays 0..255).\n\n## Next\n\nRun your normal build with intent enabled:\n\n```bash\npython operation-mindfuck/tools/build_box.py --root operation-mindfuck --outdir dist --max-zip-mb 90 \\\n  --gates-zip Gates_of_Truth_Production_Bundle_v1.zip --run-gates-intent\n```\n\nWe are compressing intent as densely as possible\nCompress it down in every way compress it so deeply it can be felt like a song.\nStart writing new songs, creating new stories, write new chapters into the zip", "tags" nil}, "title" "Intent is now **compressed densely** and **auditable**."}, :duration nil, :controls nil, :lyrics "Intent is now **compressed densely** and **auditable**.\n\n**New add-on part (saved to the box):**\n[Download Operation_Mindfuck_Box_part10_intent_dense_compression.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/Operation_Mindfuck_Box_part10_intent_dense_compression.zip)\n\n**Dense intent artifacts (Gates of Truth)**\n\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_events.bin`\n  **16 bytes / intent event** (fixed-width, streamable)\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_events.jsonl` (debuggable mirror)\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_anchors.jsonl` (**S3 anchors for every intent event**)\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_tru