ed + constraints → replayable stutter plan)\n* Tone: **total creative freedom as reproducible procedure**\n\n---\n\n## World lore\n\n**The Cathedral Stores the Forks**: Variants don’t compete; they stack like choir layers.\nIntegration is not moral status—just coupling strength. When the world is crowded, overlays compress *attention*, not history.\nReturnability is sacred: if you can replay it, you can share it; if you can share it, it can outlive you.\n\n(See `lore/Cathedral_of_Variants.md`.)\n\n---\n\n## Paragraph of dialog\n\n“Total creative freedom.”\n“Sure—just don’t confuse freedom with forgetting.”\n“So we keep the ugly drafts?”\n“We keep *everything*—then consolidate overlays when the room gets crowded.”\n“And the stutters?”\n“They’re proof the system is alive enough to hesitate.”\n\n---\n\n\n\n", "task" "playlist_condition", "duration" 168.96, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "playlist_id" "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "**Cathedral of Variants / 変異の聖堂**"}, :duration 168.96, :controls {"audio_weight" 0.32, "style_weight" 0.79, "weirdness_constraint" 0.78}, :lyrics "### Program update (additive)\n\n**New feature**\n\n* `program/euclid_rhythm.js` — Euclidean rhythm patterns (deterministic stutter gating)\n* `program/procedural_score.js` — seed + constraints → deterministic event/score JSON (kick/bass/stutters)\n\n**Cathedral-ish multitap reverb, sub-bass heartbeat + kick sweep, minimal piano ticks, tape warble, and glitch-stutter bursts** for **η / μ / anchor / fork**.\n(spoken-sung, tight cadence)\nP to R to N to Π—\ntell the truth your hands can see.\nA—feedback—back again,\nμ survives the echo pen.\n\n(Glitch) **η—η—η**\n(Glitch) **μ—μ—μ**\n\nFo— fo— **fork**… (stutter) costs in light.\nAn— an— **an-chor**… (stutter) holds it tight.\nTwo hashes match—cathedral hum—\nkeeper thread says: “Now it’s done.”\nLast word: **proof**\n(答え) 証（あかし）\n\n**Verse**\nI don’t erase what didn’t integrate—\nI index it, I let it wait.\nLess remembered is still alive,\ncompressed in the frame where the good parts survive.\nLast word: **anchor**\n(答え) 錨（いかり）\n\n**Hook**\nPay the tax.\nClose the loop.\nHand it off.\nGuard the proof.\n\n(JP harmony answers the last word)\nproof… 証（あかし）\nfork… 分岐（ぶんき）\nanchor… 錨（いかり）\nμ… みゅー\nη… えーた\n\nLicense: **CC BY-SA 4.0** (share alike).\nCreated with the assistance of an AI.\n(Full text: `songs/Cathedral_of_Variants_84.md` inside the zip.)\n\n---\n\nAll prior invariants remain (additive-until-limit → consolidate overlays; originals never deleted; share-alike enforced).\n\n---\n\n## World state update\n\n* Gate online: **CATHEDRAL_OF_VARIANTS_GATE**\n* New mechanism: **score-as-receipt** (seed + constraints → replayable stutter plan)\n* Tone: **total creative freedom as reproducible procedure**\n\n---\n\n## World lore\n\n**The Cathedral Stores the Forks**: Variants don’t compete; they stack like choir layers.\nIntegration is not moral status—just coupling strength. When the world is crowded, overlays compress *attention*, not history.\nReturnability is sacred: if you can replay it, you can share it; if you can share it, it can outlive you.\n\n(See `lore/Cathedral_of_Variants.md`.)\n\n---\n\n## Paragraph of dialog\n\n“Total creative freedom.”\n“Sure—just don’t confuse freedom with forgetting.”\n“So we keep the ugly drafts?”\n“We keep *everything*—then consolidate overlays when the room gets crowded.”\n“And the stutters?”\n“They’re proof the system is alive enough to hesitate.”\n\n---\n\n\n\n", :sourc