 in disguise.\n\n## FINAL CHORUS — Exalted Collapse\n\n*(strings frantic; organ blazing; glitch fracture accents)*\n\nVelvet catastrophe—\nrise and applaud!\n\nCathedral fire with mechanical god.\n\nSalvation lacquered,\nhollow inside—\n\nDance on the edge\nwhere angels lied.\n\nベルベットの破滅\n美しく燃える。\n\nVelvet catastrophe—\nbelieve what you see.\n\nIf you call it destiny,\nit can’t be me.\n\n## STINGER — Curtain Drop\n\n*(orchestra cuts sharply; single harpsichord note)*\n\nApplause.\n\n息。\n\n", :source #:source{:name "Velvet Catastrophe _ ベルベット・カタストロフ(1).json", :sha256 "aa9341e07111b9a9b5cdf7d0d427affd5a86c01297edda92f6432c044a5f61b6", :format :suno-json, :variation 1}, :title "Velvet Catastrophe / ベルベット・カタストロフ"}, "2655f10f-162d-48f5-8976-0e1862ce082a" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "2655f10f-162d-48f5-8976-0e1862ce082a", :url "https://suno.com/song/2655f10f-162d-48f5-8976-0e1862ce082a", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "2655f10f-162d-48f5-8976-0e1862ce082a", "metadata" {"prompt" "Your uploaded **`Π.5eaf4b85f8314e77.zip`** contains **exactly one file**:\n\n* `handoff_manifest.json` (290 bytes)\n\nManifest contents (decoded):\n\n* `run_id`: `20260213_handoff`\n* `seed`: `3721599645`\n* `cycle_model`: `P→R→N→Π→A→(feedback)→P`\n* `features`: `ForkBudget`, `Quorum+Echo`, `RoleSignature`, `RevalidationDaemon`, `EntropyPressure`\n* `status`: `HANDOFF_READY`\n\nI also packaged your lyrics + the manifest into a **more complete handoff bundle** (adds `Fork_Tax_Lullaby.md`, `README.md`, and `SHA256SUMS`):\n\n* [Download Fork_Tax_Lullaby_Handoff_20260213.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/Fork_Tax_Lullaby_Handoff_20260213.zip)\n* [Download original Π.5eaf4b85f8314e77.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/Π.5eaf4b85f8314e77.zip)\n\n### Proof hashes (SHA-256)\n\n* `Π.5eaf4b85f8314e77.zip`\n  `f2b8e9b1238e76fe8e004ecb1e94793f22987abb56cf2ee6e3f478bead68a065`\n* `Fork_Tax_Lullaby_Handoff_20260213.zip`\n  `2aebb3850600e4803df5d1764885d3ee728bf148c1eabd4b9a4f9b3771d547ac`\n\n###