image_url" "https://cdn2.suno.ai/image_391e1147-dea3-4b8c-a21c-09628ce3d6c6.jpeg", "isCover" false, "isLiked" false, "isRemaster" false, "metadata" {"uses_latest_model" false, "stream" true, "is_remix" false, "priority" 0, "tags" "Hyper-glossy kawaii bass and cinematic dubstep hybrid, male vocals. Intro builds with distant anime one-shots and filtered arps rising over a thick, detuned bass swell. Verses ride a tense half-time groove with glitchy stutters and bitcrushed fills, vocal very affected and close. Choruses slam into full-power four-on-the-floor meets riddim-style drops, stacked harmonies and vocoder doubles, bright leads cutting through the low-end growl. Bridge goes to an emotional, atmospheric break with chopped vocal phrases and distant choir, then snaps into a final, maximal drop and abrupt tail., cinematic dubstep, anime, electronic, electronicore, soaring, rapid", "can_remix" true, "prompt" "[Verse 1]\nCursor on the map\nBut the map keeps changing\nEvery door I open\nLeads to one more cage\nPixels on my skin\nFlicker like a warning\n“System error\nHeart”\nFlashing on the page\n\nI’ve been breathing static\nNaming it “control”\nFighting cardboard bosses\nIn a looping role\n\n[Chorus]\nI’m breaking out this neon escape sequence\nRewriting all the limits they coded in\nNo more living as a glitch in their system\nI’m carving my own path in the overflow\n\nI’m breaking out this neon escape sequence\nEvery scar turns into a power-up glow\nI was born to crash their perfect illusion\nWatch me hit “reset” and take control\n\n[Verse 2]\nVoices in my head\nSound like auto-translation\nTelling me to shrink\nTill I disappear\nBut the fear gets quiet\nWhen the rage gets honest\nI can hear a chorus\nCutting through the smear\n\nAll the hurt they handed\nI convert to light\nStack it like a combo\nTill I win this fight (hey!)\n\n[Chorus]\nI’m breaking out this neon escape sequence\nRewriting all the limits they coded in\nNo more living as a glitch in their system\nI’m