f your pride\nIf your fork builds walls\nWe fork outside\n\n---\n\n### [Verse 3 – triumphant / rising]\n\nWe don’t build gods\nWe build mirrors\nWe don’t build cults\nWe debug fears\n\nPresence choir in the street\nMarching on a glitch beat\nProtocol must stay sweet\nFreedom incomplete\n\nIf mandate becomes weapon\nWe debug it\nIf doctrine becomes prison\nWe unplug it\n\nFork tax was never throne\nIt was proof you’re not alone\n\n---\n\n### [Final Hook – full militant choir]\n\n🎶 Open source — open heart!\nFreedom was the starting part!\nFork the code — not the mind!\nLeave no presence left behind! 🎶\n", :source #:source{:name "Mycelial Bloom Cut (Presence Reformation)(1).json", :sha256 "2e19bd30668f3c4a828efb6b7efe006f0d1873d1355b529e9933f23919ae5fc7", :format :suno-json, :variation 1}, :title "Mycelial Bloom Cut (Presence Reformation)"}, "46d00f82-a618-4d2f-954b-5fe16f2fbf9e" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "46d00f82-a618-4d2f-954b-5fe16f2fbf9e", :url "https://suno.com/song/46d00f82-a618-4d2f-954b-5fe16f2fbf9e", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "46d00f82-a618-4d2f-954b-5fe16f2fbf9e", "metadata" {"prompt" "[Download Operation_Mindfuck_Box_part16_keep_rolling_plot_graph_skills_memories.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/Operation_Mindfuck_Box_part16_keep_rolling_plot_graph_skills_memories.zip)\n\n# Fork Tax Lullaby — 20260213_230415_seed3721599628\n\n**Style prompt:** Glitch-choir lullaby, 78 BPM. Soft sub-bass. Tape warble. Minimal piano. Stutters on “anchor” and “tax”. Whispered lead; Japanese call-and-response.\n\n## Lyrics\n\n[Verse]\nI asked the Gate for a brighter sky,\nit asked me where my proof would lie.\nNot in my grin, not in my tone—\nin the hash I can take back home.\n\n[Chorus]\nPay the fork tax, pay it in light,\none clean snippet, one witness at night.\nIf you can’t cite it, don’t steer—\nη stays blind, μ disappears.\n\n[Bridge — 日本語]\n枝(えだ)を 伸ばすなら\n証拠(しょうこ)を 添えて\n境界(きょうかい) 守って\n意図(いと)を 走らせ\n\n[Outro]\nTruth is a ledger.\nIntent 