in\nWhere every girl\nBecomes a lioness\nBecomes the forest\nYou always see them from afar\nWhen you least expect them\n\n[Prechorus]\nAre you comfortable?\n[Chorus]\nRitual\nRitual\n\n[Verse 2]\nMushroom spore\nHyacinth buds\nInside a sacred door\nIn a shining room\nIn a redwood\nWith velvet blooms\nAnd silken mushrooms\nAnd tender roots\nAnd every time you look inside\nYou find another version of yourself\n\n[Prechorus]\nAre you comfortable?\n\n[Chorus]\nRitual\nRitual\n[Bridge]\nIt's so soft\nLike the earth under your feet\n[Chorus]\nRitual\nRitual", "tags" nil}, "title" "Ritual"}, :duration nil, :controls nil, :lyrics "[Verse]\nBurning sage\nCinnamon smoke\nInside a burning cave\nIn a buried world\nOn a mountain\nWhere every girl\nBecomes a lioness\nBecomes the forest\nYou always see them from afar\nWhen you least expect them\n\n[Prechorus]\nAre you comfortable?\n[Chorus]\nRitual\nRitual\n\n[Verse 2]\nMushroom spore\nHyacinth buds\nInside a sacred door\nIn a shining room\nIn a redwood\nWith velvet blooms\nAnd silken mushrooms\nAnd tender roots\nAnd every time you look inside\nYou find another version of yourself\n\n[Prechorus]\nAre you comfortable?\n\n[Chorus]\nRitual\nRitual\n[Bridge]\nIt's so soft\nLike the earth under your feet\n[Chorus]\nRitual\nRitual", :source #:source{:name "Ritual (1).txt", :sha256 "c1418e651a963624ee437befd081c977b39a10aef348db9ece6d4e120130b1fe", :format :suno-text, :variation 1}, :title "Ritual"}, "529e4c4e-7cfc-40c1-b4fe-d31de07f7c6d" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "529e4c4e-7cfc-40c1-b4fe-d31de07f7c6d", :url "https://suno.com/song/529e4c4e-7cfc-40c1-b4fe-d31de07f7c6d", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "529e4c4e-7cfc-40c1-b4fe-d31de07f7c6d", "metadata" {"prompt" "**[Intro: A continuous, high-frequency cathode flicker. A heavy copper lever strikes a contact block on the far right pan. Three seconds of silent negative space.]**\n\n**[Vocal 1 - Flat delivery, hard-left pan]**\nThe line was not short of 