ng—\nI remember *less*.\n\n(JP harmony, last word)\n少し（すこし）\n\n**Final line**\nBut less remembered still moves through you.\nLast word: **you**\n(JP answer) 君（きみ）\n\n---\n\n#fnord", :source #:source{:name "__ECS Lullaby (Registry Child) _ レジストリの子__(whisper)I count my breath in entities—一つ、二つ...(ひとつ、ふたつ (1).txt", :sha256 "1cf178f7598cc08e90d14317139f194f7fedb7dde6f03fb3590e89bf5dc077df", :format :suno-text, :variation 1}, :title "**ECS Lullaby (Registry Child) / レジストリの子**"}, "54ade212-2886-4d37-85f4-030e675e1ebd" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "54ade212-2886-4d37-85f4-030e675e1ebd", :url "https://suno.com/song/54ade212-2886-4d37-85f4-030e675e1ebd", :liked false, :styles "**Genre/Style:** Explosive baroque-pop opera × gothic orchestral combat × choral confrontation. 132 BPM driving 4/4 (faster than prior duels). Aggressive staccato strings, rapid harpsichord ostinatos, militant snare, rolling timpani, pipe-organ blasts, low brass stabs. Choir in urgent call-and-response. Subtle glitch fractures during impacts.\n\n**Vocal Direction:** Multi-perspective battle piece. Queen soprano at full blade intensity (near coloratura attack). Rebel mezzo/tenor grounded but fierce. Guild choir firm, declarative. At climax, Queen transitions from rage to controlled command—no breakdown, only decisive authority.\n\n**Mood:** Collision. Fire against system. Responsibility under pressure. The moment everything could shatter—and doesn’t.\n\n**Structure:** Violent Overture → Clash Verse → Rebel Declaration → Guild Decree → Queen Ascension → Sudden Silence → Stand Down Command → Orchestral Release.\n", :created-at nil, :model "v5", :raw {"audio_url" "https://cdn1.suno.ai/54ade212-2886-4d37-85f4-030e675e1ebd.mp3", "id" "54ade212-2886-4d37-85f4-030e675e1ebd", "image_url" "https://cdn2.suno.ai/image_54ade212-2886-4d37-85f4-030e675e1ebd.jpeg", "isCover" false, "isLiked" false, "isRemaster" false, "metadata" {"uses_latest_model" true, "stream" true, "is_remix" false, "priority" 10, "tags" "**Genre/Style:** Explosive baroque-pop opera × gothic orchestral combat × choral confrontation. 132 BPM driving 4/4 (faster than prior duels). Aggressive staccato strings, rapid harpsichord ostinatos, militant snare, rolling timpani, pipe-organ blasts, low brass stabs. Choir in urgent call-and-response. Subtle glitch fractures during impacts.\n\n**Vocal Direction:** Multi-perspective battle piece. Queen soprano at full blade intensity (near coloratura attack). Rebel mezzo/tenor grounded but fierce. Guild choir firm, declarative. At climax, Queen transitions from rage to controlled command—no breakdown, only decisive authority.\n\n**Mood:** Collision. Fire against system. Responsibility under pressure. The moment everything could shatter—and doesn’t.\n\n**Structure:** Violent Overture → Clash Verse → Rebel Declaration → Guild Decree → Queen Ascension → Sudden Silence → Stand Down Command → Orchestral Release.\n", "can_remix" true, "prompt" "## OVERTURE — Impact\n\n*(snare crack; organ blast; strings in furious motion)*\n\nStone splits.\nSteel rings.\n\nThe sanctuary screams.\n\n## CLASH — Crossed Blades\n\nChoir:\nFracture the arch! Hold the line!\n\nRebel:\nNot for glory—\nFor the spine—\n\nQueen:\nYou dare raise hands\nagainst my sign?\n\n*(orchestra surges; rapid string runs)*\n\n## REBEL DECLARATION\n\n*(music tightens; snare steady)*\n\nI did not come to take your throne.\nI came because the ground has groaned.\n\nJustice twisted into flame—\n\nI will not let it burn the frame.\n\n証よりも\n今は守る。\n\n## GUILD DECREE\n\n*(choir unified, rhythmic and firm)*\n\nContinuity.\nPreservation.\n\nSystem over coronation.\n\nNo more spectacle.\nNo more fall.\n\nThe structure must outlive us all.\n\n## QUEEN ASCENSION — Fury Peak\n\n*(soprano soaring, rapid high notes)*\n\nStructure bends to sovereign will!\nI forged the sky—\nI reign still!\n\nIf stone has cracked,\nIt cracked for me!\n\nI am the axis of decree!\n\n鷹は落ちぬ！\n\n*(orchestra at maximum blaze; tempo pushes forward)*\n\n## SUDDEN SILENCE\n\n*(all instruments cut except distant waterfall)*\n\n—\n\n## THE REBEL — Simple Truth\n\n*(low strings re-enter; no snare)*\n\nLook at me.\n\nI wear their colors.\n\nNot because they chose me.\n\nBecause I chose this.\n\nIf you win—\nThere is no world left to rule.\n\n## THE MOMENT\n\n*(single sustained chord; soprano breath audible)*\n\nQueen (soft, trembling under control):\n\n…\n\n## STAND DOWN COMMAND\n\n*(organ low; no frenzy)*\n\nStand down.\n\n*(pause)*\n\nI said—\n\nStand.\nDown.\n\n号令の断絶。\n\n## ORCHESTRAL RELEASE\n\n*(strings shift to major undertone; choir sustained hum; snare absent)*\n\nChoir (soft):\nThe blade lowers.\nThe storm recedes.\n\nRebel (low):\nNo victory.\n\nQueen (steady):\nNo defeat.\n\nWaterfall rises in volume.\n\n## CODA\n\n*(orchestra thins; organ warm; choir sustained)*\n\nNot broken.\n\nNot crowned.\n\nBreath held—\n\nThen released.\n\n息。\n", "duration" 192.68, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "The Stand Down / 号令の断絶"}, :duration 192.68, :controls nil, :lyrics "## OVERTURE — Impact\n\n*(snare crack; organ blast; strings in furious motion)*\n\nStone splits.\nSteel rings.\n\nThe sanctuary screams.\n\n## CLASH — Crossed Blades\n\nChoir:\nFracture the arch! Hold the line!\n\nRebel:\nNot for glory—\nFor the spine—\n\nQueen:\nYou dare raise hands\nagainst my sign?\n\n*(orchestra surges; rapid string runs)*\n\n## REBEL DECLARATION\n\n*(music tightens; snare steady)*\n\nI did not come to take your throne.\nI came because the gr