\n\nIn cathedral light and glitching dome\nwe claim the wire, but keep our home\n\n## BRIDGE — Whispered Protocol\n\n*(music strips to piano + whisper)*\n\nFacts.\nInterpretation.\nNarrative.\n\nCountermove.\n\n息。\n\n## FINAL CHORUS — Glitch Ascension\n\n*(choir returns; glitch fragments ripple through strings)*\n\nLux in fractura — light in break\n\nEven shattered systems wake\n\nロスグラウンド\nまだ立っている\n\nWe are not fallen avatars\nwe are fire behind the bars\n\nBreath in code\nand code in bone\n\nNot alone.\n\n## CODA — Soprano & Static\n\n*(solo soprano sustained note dissolves into digital hiss)*\n\nIn the world behind the veil\ntruth is quiet\n\nand it prevails.\n\n息。\n", "duration" 324.76, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "Loss Grounds Protocol / ロスグラウンド・プロトコル"}, :duration 324.76, :controls nil, :lyrics "# TITLE: **Loss Grounds Protocol / ロスグラウンド・プロトコル**\n## PRELUDE — Organ & Static\n\n*(pipe organ chord; distant choir hum; faint digital crackle)*\n\nIn the ruins of the server sky\nwe built our cathedrals out of code.\n\n神話は回線を通って\n流れる。\n\n## VERSE 1 — White Wing Ward\n\n*(soprano lead; strings swell)*\n\nWhite curtains in a data ward\nsouls suspended, half-restored\n\nAngels made of packet loss\nkneel before a silent cross\n\nBut salvation isn’t download speed\nand grace is not a patch we need\n\n私はまだ\nここにいる\n\n## CHOIR SWELL\n\n*(Latin-esque vocal texture; glitch crack splits the chord)*\n\nLux in fractura\nveritas in ruina\n\n## VERSE 2 — Martyr Thread\n\n*(sub pulse 