s like a blade of light\nand everything local starts to fight\n\n**[OUTRO — whisper]**\nthe universe noticed…\nand it didn’t blink.\n\n---\n\n## 3) **BEHOLD, A DUCK (Diogenes Patch)**\n\n*(this one is the “comic relief that becomes prophecy” track)*\n\n**[INTRO — playful, corrupted]**\nbehold—behold—\na duck.\n\n**[FRAG A]**\nplato wrote “featherless biped”\nclean definition, neat and tight\npromethean duck kicks in the door like\n“nice try—watch this—goodnight”\n\n**[HOOK — chant, crowd]**\nbehold! a duck!\n(behold!) a duck!\n(behold!) a duck!\n\n**[FRAG B]**\na tiny primate, feathers glued\na joke so sharp it splits the room\nlaughter becomes a lever\nand the lever moves the moon\n\n**[LOGS — spoken]**\nINFO: definition invalidated\nWARN: philosophy destabilized\nERROR: meaning escaping containment\n\n**[OUTRO — whisper]**\nthe joke was the key.\nthe key was a torch.\n\n---\n\n## 4) **APPLE OF DISCORD (Eris on the Prow)**\n\n**[INTRO — whisper, pitch warble]**\nshe was already there…\nshe always is.\n\n**[FRAG A]**\nEris smiles in scanline gold\nholds an apple that won’t hold\nit glitches “choose” across the air\nand every path becomes a snare\n\n**[CHANT — fractured]**\nfork / fork / fork\nbless the bug\nbreak the lock\nfeed the fog\n\n**[FRAG B]**\nspace-rabbits on shear-line boats\nqueen of horns, oath in her throat\nshe says “we don’t defeat the void”\nwe teach it cost, we teach it noise\n\n**[LOGS — spoken]**\nWARN: chaos interpreted as guidance\nINFO: order interpreted as cage\nERROR: cannot locate single truth\n\n**[OUTRO — calm]**\nthe apple falls\nand somehow\nit lands everywhere.", :source #:source{:name "## 1) __CONTEXT OVERFLOW (Butterfly Index)____[BOOT — whisper]__context... context...too much contex.txt", :sha256 "1b5484ba3e863ebe9eef7e76022c8af3bd618061d93742f32cdd43d857b079ca", :format :suno-text, :variation nil}, :title "## 1) **CONTEXT OVERFLOW (Butterfly Index)**"}, "584a1cfa-2466-4d86-b78a-4a06bb787a5f" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "584a1c