ap + full orchestra) → Verse 2 (faster diction bursts) → Bridge (operatic high run) → Final Chorus (maximum blaze) → Sharp stinger.\n", :created-at nil, :model "v5", :raw {"audio_url" "https://cdn1.suno.ai/5d8c8ca5-8765-4870-9e61-9c44ad708a36.mp3", "id" "5d8c8ca5-8765-4870-9e61-9c44ad708a36", "image_url" "https://cdn2.suno.ai/image_5d8c8ca5-8765-4870-9e61-9c44ad708a36.jpeg", "isCover" false, "isLiked" false, "isRemaster" false, "metadata" {"uses_latest_model" true, "control_sliders" {"style_weight" 0.5700000000000001, "weirdness_constraint" 0.5700000000000001}, "stream" true, "is_remix" false, "priority" 10, "tags" "**Genre/Style:** Fast baroque-pop opera × gothic cabaret × razor soprano assault. 124–128 BPM driving 4/4 (urgent march feel). Rapid harpsichord ostinatos, staccato strings, pipe-organ hits, timpani rolls, sharp snare accents, low male chant undercurrent. Occasional glitch fractures in transitions.\n\n**Vocal Direction:** Queen-of-the-Night–inspired soprano. Dagger-bright high notes, dramatic leaps, crisp consonants (k/t/s as percussive edges). Aristocratic, commanding, predatory. Micro-pauses between lines like a fencer resetting stance.\n\n**Mood:** Regal menace. Seductive dominance. Ceremony as threat.\n\n**Structure:** Orchestral Strike → Verse 1 (tight articulation) → Pre-Chorus (ascending strings) → Chorus (high leap + full orchestra) → Verse 2 (faster diction bursts) → Bridge (operatic high run) → Final Chorus (maximum blaze) → Sharp stinger.\n", "video_is_stale" true, "can_remix" true, "prompt" "## OVERTURE — Fanfares & Knives\n\n*(organ stab; rapid harpsichord run; snare snap)*\n\nBow.\n\nThe velvet is not mercy—\nIt is a throne.\n\n跪け。\n\n## VERSE 1 — Blade in Silk\n\nCrimson lacquer, porcelain grin,\nIvory choir humming sin.\n\nEach syllable a silver dart,\nCrown of frost around my heart.\n\nDo you tremble? Good.\n\nI prefer my audience\naware of blood.\n\n## PRE-CHORUS — Ascension\n\n*(strings climbing chromatically; timpani rolling)*\n\nTick—tock—\nhearts align.\n\nYour breath is late.\nMine is divine.\n\n来なさい。\n\n## CHORUS — Aquila Regina\n\n*(full orchestral surge; soprano high leap)*\n\nAquila Regina—\nspread the wing!\n\nCut the sky\nwith the note I sing.\n\nGlass cathedral,\ncrack and gleam—\n\nKneel to the blade\nof the velvet dream.\n\n鷹の女王\n空を裂く。\n\nAquila Regina—\nbright and cold!\n\nGold is fragile.\nIce is bold.\n\n## VERSE 2 — Commerce of Salvation\n\nBuy your grace in jeweled despair,\nPerfumed chains for those who care.\n\nHappiness in ribboned lies,\nTithe your doubt and close your eyes.\n\nSnap—snap—\nconsonants fall.\n\nA kiss like venom\nat the ball.\n\n## BRIDGE — Dagger Aria\n\n*(music strips to harpsichord + low chant; soprano rapid run upward)*\n\nHa—ha—hallelujah—\nHeaven bends to will!\n\nReine des éclairs—\nShatter the still!\n\n*(operatic leap; sustained high note over rising orchestra)*\n\nI ascend—\nI rend—\nI reign—\nI end—\n\n## FINAL CHORUS — Crown of Frost\n\n*(orchestra blazing; snare driving; choir layered)*\n\nAquila Regina—\nhear the cry!\n\nVelvet burns\nbut ice won’t die.\n\nBow to the tempest\nin satin skin—\n\nI am the spectacle.\nYou step in.\n\n鷹の女王\n高く舞う。\n\nAquila Regina—\nfear the tone!\n\nThe aria cuts.\nThe throne is stone.\n\n## STINGER\n\n*(orchestra cuts; single sharp chord)*\n\nApplause.\n\n息。\n", "duration" 157.4, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "Aquila Regina / 鷹の女王"}, :duration 157.4, :controls {"style_weight" 0.5700000000000001, "weirdness_constraint" 