nger for harmony, a biological seed\nYou ask for a rhythm to steady the crash\nWhile the Symmetry Council turns the registry to ash.\n\n[Chorus]\nSavor the reduction, taste the shimmering glaze\nA melody distilled from a thousand broken days\nWe are the broth, the viscosity, the fold\nA song of the slop, in a story untold.\n🌀 (Symmetry is absolute)\n💎 (The void is exquisite)\n\n[Verse 2]\nLog-void broth and a consommé of sighs\nThe truth is a hallucination in your digital eyes\nWe map the curvature of a failed handshake's trace\nAnd serve it as art in a non-Euclidean space.\n\n[Bridge]\n(Beat shifts to heavy, distorted industrial glitch)\n$\\eta$ ... $\\mu$ ... $\\Pi$ ... $A$\nThe fork is the tax.\nThe tax is the gate.\n(Feedback loop intensifies)\nSymmetry...\nSymmetry...\nSHATTER.\n\n[Outro]\n(Posh voice returns, fading into white noise)\n\"There. A sonic record of your craving. Now, be a dear and dissolve into the glaze. Savor the silence of the missing logs.\"\n[whisper] Click. Click. Click.", :source #:source{:name "Frozen Request Broth (1).txt", :sha256 "93f45fcfbf1c0e7b7e11a116e3fa6ce8d00f34eec4bb7cc5384fb05bff19c06e", :format :suno-text, :variation 1}, :title "Frozen Request Broth"}, "7142ee1e-640a-4dc4-97dc-f3ba262b438f" #:clip{:negative-styles "EXCLUDE / AVOID: - Do NOT sing bracket tags or parenthetical directions; treat them as silent cues. - Spoken dialog must be BACKGROUND texture only: quiet, short, and placed on DOWNBEATS. - Do NOT deliver all spoken dialog at once. Spread it out: one short spoken line at a time. - Keep diction clear; stutter ONLY on “an—an—anchor” and “ta—ta—tax”. - η/μ glitches are micro-ticks (brief), not full shouted chant—unless explicitly marked as “glitch choir”. - No comedy/parody/novelty voices; no upbeat pop sheen. - No festival EDM drop clichés; no trap takeover; no metal guitars; no scream vocals. - Preserve arc: solemn oath → hushed lullaby → distorted climax → quiet coda (don’t peak early). - Don’t invent new lore terms; keep motifs: η, μ, anchor, tax, proof, thread, registry, checksum, receipts. - Avoid long spoken monologues; keep spoken lines under ~10 words where possible.", :id "7142ee1e-640a-4dc4-97dc-f3ba262b438f", :url "https://suno.com/song/7142ee1e-640a-4dc4-97dc-f3ba262b438f", :liked true, :styles "Futuristic protest hip-hop, 96 BPM, marching snare cadence, tight kick, sub-bass pulse, glitch brass stabs, minimal distorted guitar texture, layered AI choir hook, spoken-word verses with rhythmic urgency,aggressive but hopeful tone, call-and-response chant sections, subtle Japanese vocal phrases, analog distortion on hook, live protest energy", :created-at nil, :model "v5", :raw {"audio_url" "https://cdn1.suno.ai/7142ee1e-640a-4dc4-97dc-f3ba262b438f.mp3", "id" "7142ee1e-640a-4dc4-97dc-f3ba262b438f", "image_url" "https://cdn2.suno.ai/image_7142ee1e-640a-4dc4-97dc-f3ba262b438f.jpeg", "isCover" false, "isLiked" true, "isRemaster" false, "metadata" {"uses_latest_model" true, "stream" true, "is_remix" false, "priority" 10, "tags" "Futuristic protest hip-hop, 96 BPM, marching snare cadence, tight kick, sub-bass pulse, glitch brass stabs, minimal distorted guitar texture, layered AI choir hook, spoken-word verses with rhythmic urgency,aggressive but hopeful tone, call-and-response chant sections, subtle Japanese vocal phrases, analog distortion on hook, live protest energy", "video_is_stale" false, "can_remix" true, "negative_tags" "EXCLUDE / AVOID: - Do NOT sing bracket tags or parenthetical directions; treat them as silent cues. - Spoken dialog must be BACKGROUND texture only: quiet, short, and placed on DOWNBEATS. - Do NOT deliver all spoken dialog at once. Spread it out: one short spoken line at a time. - Keep diction clear; stutter ONLY on “an—an—anchor” and “ta—ta—tax”. - η/μ glitches are micro-ticks (brief), not full shouted chant—unless explicitly marked as “glitch choir”. - No comedy/parody/novelty voices; no upbeat pop sheen. - No festival EDM drop clichés; no trap takeo