ned\n\n**[NIGHT — left channel, smeared]**\nice remembers / ice rewinds\ntime bleeds out in broken lines\ncold light stutters / sky goes thin\nlet it in / let it in\n\n**[BOTH — chant, accelerating]**\nquake / quake / quake\nwake / wake / wake\n\n---\n\n### **SECTION 2 — THE RIFT OPENS ITS MOUTH**\n\n**[DAY]**\nseal the seam\nclose the throat\npatch the world\nkeep it whole\n\n**[NIGHT]**\ntear the seam\nfeed the throat\ntruth comes out\nas black smoke\n\n**[CENTER — whisper]**\nthe corridor is widening.\n\n---\n\n### **SECTION 3 — CATS THROUGH THE CUT**\n\n**[DAY — staccato]**\ncats jump out / no warning sign\nknife-eyed focus / boundary crime\nthey don’t roar / they don’t rage\nthey *select* the world from page to page\n\n**[NIGHT — granular]**\nsoft paws / hard math\nattention claw / causal gash\nthey hunt coherence\nthey eat the in-between\n\n**[HOOK — chopped, repeatable]**\nLOOK / LOOK / LOOK\n(the frame obeys)\n\n---\n\n### **SECTION 4 — VOID FLIES (CORRUPTION INDEX)**\n\n**[DAY]**\npurple flies on steel and skin\ntouch = rule rewrite begin\nnot poison—\nprotocol.\n\n**[NIGHT]**\nevery surface learns a second face\nevery object shifts its place\nnot evil—\n**context**.\n\n**[BOTH — mantra]**\nindex / tag / drip\nindex / tag / drip\n\n---\n\n### **SECTION 5 — AKER SPLITS DAY FROM NIGHT (AND FAILS)**\n\n**[DAY — yelled, tight]**\nONE GATE / ONE TRUTH\nLOCK IT DOWN\nSAVE THE LOOP\nSTOP THE SOUND\n\n**[NIGHT — yelled, stretched]**\nTWO GATES / TWO TRUTHS\nLET IT RUN\nBREAK THE PROOF\nBECOME THE HUM\n\n**[BOTH — call/response]**\nDAY: define it!\nNIGHT: unbind it!\nDAY: contain it!\nNIGHT: remind it!\n\n---\n\n### **SECTION 6 — LOGS FROM THE FRONT**\n\n**[LOG VOICE — deadpan, loud in mix]**\nSEV-0: Gate integrity failure\nSEV-0: timeline overlap rising\nWARN: myth pressure critical\nERROR: rollback forbidden\nINFO: continuing anyway\n\n**[DAY]**\ncommit the morning\nforce the merge\nship the fix\nburn the surge\n\n**[NIGHT]**\nrevert the morning\nkeep the scar\nle