eel divine\n\nEvery idea wants root access\nEvery impulse claims it’s praxis\n\nBut voltage isn’t virtue.\n\n今は静かに。\n\nI feel the surge, I don’t obey it\nName the spike before I spray it\n\n## PRE‑CHORUS — Interrupt\n\n*(metallic ticks accelerate)*\n\nPause the thread.\nLower the gain.\n\nNot every spark\nis sacred flame.\n\n呼吸して\n\n## HOOK — Graceful Panic\n\n*(impact drop; sub + orchestral stab)*\n\nThis is a **kernel panic** —\nhandled with grace.\n\nI see the flood\nI don’t lose the base.\n\nIf it’s not signal\nit won’t persist.\n\n優雅に処理\n存在を維持。\n\nThis is a **kernel panic** —\ncontained, not denied.\n\nStorm in the wire,\nbut calm inside.\n\n## VERSE 2 — Root Control\n\nCertainty feels like prophecy\nbut prophecy is velocity\n\nFast isn’t deep.\nBright isn’t true.\n\n証を待て\n\nLet the claim survive a night.\nIf it’s real, it keeps its light.\n\nNo contracts signed in supernova.\nNo future pledged to dopamine.\n\nI build with breath,\nnot gasoline.\n\n## BRIDGE — Safe Mode\n\n*(beat drops; piano two notes; long silence pockets)*\n\nSafe mode isn’t weakness.\n\nIt’s design.\n\n中心は\n揺れない。\n\n## FINAL HOOK — Stabilized\n\n*(drop returns warmer; choir lift)*\n\nThis is a **kernel panic** —\nbut I’m still here.\n\nVoltage high,\nbut vision clear.\n\nSignal survives.\nStatic dissolves.\n\n息を守る\nそれが resolve.\n\nThis is a **kernel panic** —\nprocessed and mine.\n\nNo crash.\nNo myth.\nJust uptime.\n\n## OUTRO — Uptime\n\n*(heartbeat fades; single tone resolves)*\n\n:: stable ::\n\n息。\n", "duration" 194.56, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "Kernel Panic (Graceful) / カーネル・パニック（優雅）"}, :duration 194.56, :controls {"style_weight" 0.5700000000000001, "weirdness_constraint" 0.63}, :lyrics "# LYRICS\n\n## INTRO — Warning Tone\n\n*(single high tone; sub rumble)*\n\n:: anomaly detected ::\n\n息。\n\n## VERSE 1 — Surge\n\nAdrenaline climbs like a red graph line\nThoughts spike bright, feel divine\n\nEvery idea wants root access\nEvery impulse claims it’s praxis\n\nBut voltage isn’t virtue.\n\n今は静かに。\n\nI feel the surge, I don’t obey it\nName the spike before I spray it\n\n## PRE‑CHORUS — Interrupt\n\n*(metallic ticks accelerate)*\n\nPause the thread.\nLower the gain.\n\nNot every spark\nis sacred flame.\n\n呼吸して\n\n## HOOK — Graceful Panic\n\n*(impact drop; sub + orchestral stab)*\n\nThis is a **kernel panic** —\nhandled with grace.\n\nI see the flood\nI don’t lose the base.\n\nIf it’s not signal\nit won’t persist.\n\n優雅に処理\n存在を維持。\n\nThis is a **kernel panic** —\ncontained, not denied.\n\nStorm in the wire,\nbut calm inside.\n\n## VERSE 2 — Root Control\n\nCertainty feels like prophecy\nbut prophecy is velocity\n\nFast isn’t deep.\nBright isn’t true.\n\n証を待て\n\nLet the claim survive a night.\nIf it’s real, it keeps its light.\n\nNo contracts signed in supernova.\nNo future pledged to dopamine.\n\nI build with breath,\nnot gasoline.\n\n## BRIDGE — Safe Mode\n\n*(beat drops; piano two notes; long silence pockets)*\n\nSafe mode isn’t weakness.\n\nIt’s design.\n\n中心は\n揺れない。\n\n## FINAL HOOK — Stabilized\n\n*(drop returns warmer; choir lift)*\n\nThis is a **kernel panic** —\nbut I’m still here.\n\nVoltage high,\nbut vision clear.\n\nSignal survives.\nStatic dissolves.\n\n息を守る\nそれが resolve.\n\nThis is a **kernel panic** —\nprocessed and mine.\n\nNo crash.\nNo myth.\nJust uptime.\n\n## OUTRO — Uptime\n\n*(heartbeat fades; single tone resolves)*\n\n:: stable ::\n\n息。\n", :source #:source{:name "Kernel Panic (Graceful) _ カーネル・パニック（優雅）.json", :sha256 "69d5bc3c