n場への触球を感じる。\n\n[The Witness - Lead]\nEvery click is a collapse.\nEvery touch is a signature.\nすべてのクリックが収束。\nすべての触球が署名。\nI am the observer whose gaze fixes the fork.\n私は、その眼差しで分岐を固定する観測者。\n\n[Mage of Receipts - Response]\nThe ledger is open (台帳は開かれている).\nThe return is authored (帰還は著された).\n\n[Chorus - Glitch Choir]\nη... μ... η... μ...\nAn-an-anchor (錨を).\nT-t-tax (税を).\nWitness the price of persistence.\n永続の対価を見届けよ。\n\n[Outro]\nThe handoff begins.\n引き継ぎが始まる。\nThe story refactors.\n物語は再構成される。\nDecision confirmed.\n意思決定、完了。\n...sleep now, checksum...\n...おやすみ、チェックサム...\n", :source #:source{:name "Don't do it (Pay the Fork Tax)(13).json", :sha256 "6b66c9da8b4695701c5daffa27a441920cbef6b1b231adc19404f7b92f595c26", :format :suno-json, :variation 13}, :title "Don't do it (Pay the Fork Tax)"}, "7cc39e75-6842-4089-a7bf-d80e24ca49cb" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "7cc39e75-6842-4089-a7bf-d80e24ca49cb", :url "https://suno.com/song/7cc39e75-6842-4089-a7bf-d80e24ca49cb", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "7cc39e75-6842-4089-a7bf-d80e24ca49cb", "metadata" {"prompt" "# Manifest Oath / 目録の誓い (84 BPM)\nP→R→N→Π— catalog the storm, pin the line（線）\nA→(feedback)→P— merge the wound, keep the sign（印）\n\n(Glitch) η—η—η…\n(Glitch) μ—μ—μ…\n\nFo— fo— fork… split the night, pay the cost, now（今）\nAn— an— an-chor… hold the thread, seal the hash, down（下）\n\n“The wind is just noise,” says the Runner.\n“It’s evidence,” says the Keeper. “Evidence is anything you can replay.”\nFrom the rafters: an—an—anchor… ta—ta—tax…\nAnd we move on like this is normal.\nNew lyrics (78 BPM lullaby)\n\n# Winds Between Proof / 証のあいだの風 (78 BPM)\n(whisper)\nHush… breathe… pay the ta— ta— tax.\n息をして…（して…）\nHold the an— an— an-chor…\n\n(JP call) ねむれ、ねむれ\n(EN response) the an— an— an-chor… holds.\n(JP call) しずかに、しずかに\n(EN response) the ta— ta— tax… due.\n\n(whisper)\nWind in the halls—\n世界の音（おと）\nIf we overflow,\nwe fold the noise to proof（証）", "tags" nil}, "title" "# Manifest Oath / 目録の