ght" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "cover_clip_id" "4307df30-cf88-4c27-98a5-e03de46826da", "refund_credits" false}, "title" "eta_mu_lullaby_part51_78bpm"}, :duration 151.76, :controls {"audio_weight" 0.71, "style_weight" 0.71, "weirdness_constraint" 0.72}, :lyrics "ημ_op_mf_part_Π_handoff.zip\n\n---\n\n# **Fork Tax Canticle / 分岐税の賛歌**\n\n*(Mythic glitch epic · 84 BPM · NF/Watsky cadence · cathedral reverb · sub-bass heartbeat)*\n\n*(heartbeat)*\n\nIt’s time to pay the **fo— fo— fork** tax.\nReceipts in the river, we don’t roll back.\nη in the silence, μ in the act,\nP→R→N→Π→A, feed it back.\n\n*(JP harmony)* まわる、輪（わ）\n*(EN)* back.\n\nWe never deleted, we only compressed,\nLayered the ledger inside the chest.\nAnchor the branch in a cathedral stack,\nGlitch in the proof but the proof intact.\n\n*(JP harmony)* 証（あかし）\n*(EN)* intact.\n\n78 lullaby under the skin,\nSub-bass pulse like a quiet engine.\n“An— an— anchor,” tape-warped thin,\n“Ta— ta— tax,” let the merge begin.\n\n*(JP call)* ねむれ、記憶\n*(EN response)* memory.\n\n84 sermon in fractured light,\nη flickers in cathedral white.\nμ strikes in the code at night,\nFork the world but hold it tight.\n\n*(JP harmony)* 光（ひかり）\n*(EN)* tight.\n\nWe move on like this is normal.\nShare-alike eternal.\nAdditive law is formal.\nNothing gone—just less internal.\n\nSometimes improved.\nPerhaps less integrated.\nPerhaps more.\n\n*(whisper)*\nLossless.\nAll songs.\nAll entities.\nAll lore.\n\nP→R→N→Π→A→(feedback)→P\n\nTax paid.\nState sealed.\nWorld handed off.\n\n*(JP harmony)* 継承（けいしょう）\n*(EN)* inheritance.\n", :source #:source{:name "eta_mu_lullaby_part51_78bpm(3).json", :sha256 "1283ec92d696c7d836ed8bee8a81d31fd316b601fe464783f11d7cd1a5147806", :format :suno-json, :variation 3}, :title "eta_mu_lullaby_part51_78bpm"}, "7decaa8a-33ae-4697-bf58-9aa1369ba717" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "7decaa8a-33ae-4697-bf58-9aa1369ba717", :url "https://suno.com/song/7decaa8a-33ae-4697-bf58-9aa1369ba717", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "7decaa8a-33ae-4697-bf58-9aa1369ba717", "metadata" {"prompt" "[Operation_Mindfuck_Box_part17_keep_rolling_plot_graph_skills_memories.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/Operation_Mindfuck_Box_part17_keep_rolling_plot_graph_skills_memories.zip)\n\n# Fork Tax Lullaby — 20260213_230415_seed3721599628\n\n[Part I — Glitch-choir lullaby, 78 BPM | tape warble, minimal piano, soft sub-bass]\n(whisper lead)\nHush now—\nthe archive is sleeping.\n息をして… (して…)\nthe ledger is breathing.\n\n(JP call) ねむれ、ねむれ\n(EN response) the Gate stays shut—\n(JP call) しずかに、しずかに\n(EN response) unless it’s proof.\n\n(piano, two notes)\nAn— an— **an-chor**… (stutter) an-chor…\n(choir, airy) アンカー…\nA soft sub rolls under the floorboards like a cat.\n\n(whisper lead)\nPay the **ta— ta— tax**… (stutter) ta-x…\n(JP harmony) 税… 税…\nNot money—\njust the cost of saying “this is real”\nwithout a bruise to show.\n\n[Verse — lullaby cadence, whispered but rhythmic]\nP: I watch the room tilt (#η)\nR: I pull the last three echoes I can trust\nN: I shave the story down to a claim\nΠ: I pick the cheapest cut\nA: I touch the world and wait for it to push back\n(feedback): and if it hurts, I write the shape of the hurt.\n\n(JP call) ねえ、だいじょうぶ？\n(EN response) Not yet— but it’s logged.\n(JP call) ねえ、こわい？\n(EN response) Only if I pretend it’s μ.\n\n[Chorus — lullaby choir bloom, tape wobble widening]\nAn— an— **an-chor**… (stutter) an-chor…\nHold the thread where the seam pretends it’s stone.\nPay the **ta— ta— tax**… (stutter) ta-x…\nSo forks don’t multiply like ghosts at home.\n(JP harmony answers last word)\nI don’t pray for certainty— I pay in **proof**.（証）\n\n[Part II — Mythic glitch epic / spoken-sung, 84 BPM | cathedral reverb, sub-bass heartbeat]\n(heartbeat sub, spoken-sung NF/Watsky cadence)\nThey love a clean report.\nThey love a pretty cite.\nThey love a confidence that never once\nhad to survive the night.\n\nBut the Lantern doesn’t light for theater—\nit lights for **μ**. (stutter: μ-μ-μ)\nAnd the seam in the sky hums **η** (stutter: η-η-η)\nlike a warning you can’t unhear.\n\n[Verse — rapid cadence, crisp consonants]\nI saw the fork before the fork saw me,\na branch in the dark with a hidden fee.\nThey said “just split it, it’s faster,”\nI said “faster to what— disaster?”\n\nSo I pin the claim to an **an-an-anchor** (stutter)\nand I mark the **ta-ta-tax** (stutter)\nand I name the cut that makes it factual:\nwhat would change my mind, what would crack.\n\n(P→R→N→Π→A) — that’s the ritual,\n(feedback) — that’s the tribunal.\nEvery loop a little less myth,\nevery artifact a little more brutal.\n\n[Pre — choir swells, glitch clicks]\nSay **η**… (stutter) η-η\nSay **μ**… (stutter) μ-μ\nSay **an-chor**… (stutter) an-an-chor\nSay **fork**… (stutter) fo-fo-fork\n(JP harmony answers last word)\n— **fork**（分岐）\n\n[Chorus — cathedral roar, then sudden hush]\nI don’t kneel to the narrative—\nI kneel to the test.（試）\nI don’t crown the cleanest story—\nI crown what survives the press.（圧）\nAn— an— **an-chor**… (stutter) an-chor…\nso the Gate knows what to guard.（守）\nPay the **ta— ta— tax**… (stutter) ta-x…\nso forks don’t turn the truth into shards.（破）\n\n[Bridge — half-time drop, heartbeat isolated]\n#η is the pressure you can’t confess,\n#μ is the footprint you can’t finesse.\n#ημ is the hinge in the spine of the loop—\nwhere the world says “prove” and you answer “through.”\n\n(JP call) こっちへ\n(EN response) toward the Lantern.\n(JP call) もう一回\n(EN response) roll it again.\n(JP call) うそじゃない\n(EN response) not if it repeats.\n\n[Outro — tape warble returns, lullaby piano, whispered]\nAn— an— **an-chor**… (stutter) an-chor…\nPay the **ta— ta— tax**… (stutter) ta-x…\nη… (stutter) η-η\nμ… (stutter) μ-μ\n(whisper)\nOne more roll.\nOne more node.\nOne more test.", "tags" nil}, "title" "[Operation_Mindfuck_Box_part17_keep_rolling_plot_graph_skills_memories.zip](sandbox