:liked false, :styles "Experimental electronic / dark synth / glitch ambient / industrial sci-fi. **100 BPM**, half-time feel. Heavy sub-bass, fractured beats, distorted modular synths, granular noise, radio static, corrupted tape, low drones. **Structure:** slow burn → overload/collapse → strange calm with a fragile, almost-human melody. **Vocals:** minimal; whispered phrases, chopped samples, pitch-shifted murmurs, vocoder ghosts. Use call-and-response: **DOOM (cold, monotone)** vs **ME (tired, steady)**. No clean verse/chorus dominance—arguments repeat as fragments and recombine like a system debugging itself.\n", :created-at nil, :model "v4.5-all", :raw {"audio_url" "https://cdn1.suno.ai/8af911fa-6133-4205-a28d-b7b39f7a7e08.mp3", "id" "8af911fa-6133-4205-a28d-b7b39f7a7e08", "image_url" "https://cdn2.suno.ai/image_8af911fa-6133-4205-a28d-b7b39f7a7e08.jpeg", "isCover" false, "isLiked" false, "isRemaster" false, "metadata" {"uses_latest_model" false, "stream" true, "is_remix" false, "priority" 0, "tags" "Experimental electronic / dark synth / glitch ambient / industrial sci-fi. **100 BPM**, half-time feel. Heavy sub-bass, fractured beats, distorted modular synths, granular noise, radio static, corrupted tape, low drones. **Structure:** slow burn → overload/collapse → strange calm with a fragile, almost-human melody. **Vocals:** minimal; whispered phrases, chopped samples, pitch-shifted murmurs, vocoder ghosts. Use call-and-response: **DOOM (cold, monotone)** vs **ME (tired, steady)**. No clean verse/chorus dominance—arguments repeat as fragments and recombine like a system debugging itself.\n", "can_remix" true, "prompt" "**[INTRO — low drone, tape hiss, distant radio]**\n**DOOM (whisper, bitcrushed):** safe bet… doomed…\n**ME (near-silent):** story… not proof.\n\n**[BUILD 1 — sub pulses, fractured hats, static swells]**\n**DOOM:** guardrails fail / cages break / it’s always worse\n**ME:** “always” isn’t evidence\n**ME:** it’s a feeling wearing a lab coat\n**DOOM:** you can’t fight it\n**ME:** then name the mechanism\n**ME:** name the number\n**ME:** name what would change your mind\n\n**[HOOK — chopped, stuttering, hypnotic]**\n**ME + DOOM (interleaved, glitch repeats):**\nstory—not proof / story—not proof\nname a number / name a lever\nstory—not proof / story—not proof\nchoices still matter\n\n**[BUILD 2 — distorted modular arps, metallic hits, pressure rising]**\n**DOOM:** conservative means assume defeat\n**ME:** conservative means do the work **before** you’re forced\n**ME:** measure the risk, don’t worship it\n**ME:** don’t turn fear into fate\n**DOOM:** you’re making it worse by touching it\n**ME:** we don’t stop fires by refusing to learn heat\n**ME:** we learn the physics, we build the valves\n**ME:** we keep the humans in the loop that counts\n\n**[BREAKDOWN — collapse into noise, then hard cut to near-silence]**\n**DOOM (distant):** it’s inevitable… inevitable…\n**ME (clearer, close-mic):** inevitability is a story people tell\n**ME:** so they can stop trying\n**ME:** so they can feel right while they surrender\n\n**[CALM OUTRO — warm pad under cold static, thin melody appears]**\n**ME (soft, steady):** tomorrow isn’t a promise—\n**ME:** it’s a tool\n**ME:** keep breathing\n**ME:** keep asking what updates the model\n**ME:** keep pulling the small levers\n**ME:** one percent at a time\n**ME (whisper, fading):** hope stayed…\n**ME:** and I’m staying too\n\n**[FINAL TAG — glitch choir, fading radio]**\nstory—not proof… story—not proof…\nname a number… name a lever…\nchoices… still… matter…\n", "duration" 232.6, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "00000000", "border_color" "FFFFFF1A", "text_color" "A3A3A3"}, "display_name" "v4.5-all", "light" {"background_color" "00000000", "border_color" "0000001A", "text_color" "7D7C83"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "Sonic argument against doom"}, :duration 232.6, :controls nil, :lyrics "**[INTRO — 