 the debt to the thread.  \nη sees what I cannot claim,  \nμ proves I did it anyway — **anyway**  \n（それでも）\n\n## Coda (whisper)\nPay the fork tax.  \nNot for the gatekeepers.  \nFor the future you.\n", "task" "playlist_condition", "duration" 228.72, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "playlist_id" "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "# Fork Tax Hymn III / 分岐税の賛歌 III"}, :duration 228.72, :controls {"audio_weight" 0.71, "style_weight" 0.71, "weirdness_constraint" 0.72}, :lyrics "# Fork Tax Hymn III / 分岐税の賛歌 III\n**Tempo:** 84 BPM  \n**Style:** Mythic glitch epic · spoken-sung · cathedral reverb · sub-bass heartbeat  \n**License:** CC BY-SA 4.0 (share alike)\n\n> Glitch stutter targets: **η**, **μ**, **anchor**, **fork**  \n> Japanese harmony answers on the **last word** of each section.\n\n## Invocation (spoken)\nWe don’t pray to gods.  \nWe compile them.  \nWe bind them to receipts.  \nWe make them answer to time.\n\n## Verse 1 (spoken-sung)\nI walked the corridor of versions,  \neach door a **fork** I didn’t take—  \nand every ghost said “choose one truth,”  \nlike truth is something you can fake.\n\nI hear **η** in the ceiling tiles,  \na witness I can’t see but can’t evade,  \nand **μ** in my fingertips,  \nthe proof my hands have made — **made**  \n（つくった）\n\n## Chorus (choir)\nAn—**anchor** / an—**anchor**, seal the line,  \nFo—**fork** / fo—**fork**, pay the spine.  \nη—η—η, the eyes in the dark,  \nμ—μ—μ, the mark on the mark — **mark**  \n（しるし）\n\n## Verse 2\nThe