opranos:\nHear the aria cut like glass—\n\nTenors:\nHear the answer—steady, brass—\n\nAltos:\nVelocity and vertical flame—\n\nBasses:\nContinuance without a name—\n\nAll:\nWhat is power without a crown?\nWhat is rising without down?\n\n## BRIDGE — Guild Counsel\n\n*(music drops; whispering choir; faint glitch shimmer)*\n\nObserve.\n\nDo not inherit the rage.\n\nRemember:\nEvery queen was once a page.\n\nRemember:\nEvery rebel risks a throne.\n\nRemember:\nBreath is never owned.\n\n息は借り物。\n\n## FINAL REFRAIN — Vast Arena\n\n*(orchestra blazing; choir at full force; soprano descant above)*\n\nWe bear no banner—\nbut we ascend\nIn understanding\nwithout end.\n\nCrown and spine,\nblade and ground—\n\nBoth are bound\nby common sound.\n\n天上ギルド\n静かに歌う。\n\nWe bear no banner—\nwe remain.\n\nWitness to glory.\nWitness to flame.\n\n## CODA — Echo in the Heights\n\n*(choir fades; organ softens)*\n\nIn every duel of frost and will,\nThe sky is watching—\n\nStill.\n\n息。\n", "duration" 366.32, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "Chorus of the Guild Above / 天上ギルドの合唱"}, :duration 366.32, :controls nil, :lyrics "## OVERTURE — Balcony of Light\n\n*(organ swell; choir hum; strings racing beneath)*\n\nFrom the ramparts of reflected sky,\nWe watch the velvet falcon fly.\n\nAnd on the marble, unbowed flame,\nStands the one who will not claim.\n\n天上より見守る。\n\n## CHORUS VERSE I — Witness\n\nSopranos:\nCrown of frost and silver decree—\n\nTenors:\nSpine of steel in defiant key—\n\nAltos:\nBlade of song in satin air—\n\nBasses:\nGrounded pulse that does not care—\n\nAll:\nThus begins the sacred duel,\nPride as scepter, breath as rule.\n\n## PRE-CHORUS — Divided Air\n\n*(strings ascending; timpani rumble)*\n\nHigh above the shattering nave,\nNo one kneels and none are saved.\n\nTick—tock—\nthreads align.\n\nIs this fate?\nOr design?\n\n## GRAND REFRAIN — We Bear No Banner\n\n*(full orchestral surge; choir in harmony)*\n\nWe bear no banner—\nWe cast no stone.\n\nWe witness fire\nagainst the throne.\n\n鷹の女王\n跪かない\n\nTwo bright notes in mirrored sky,\nNeither willing yet to die.\n\nWe bear no banner—\nWe take no side.\n\nIn spectacle,\nwe do not hide.\n\n## CHORUS VERSE II — The Measure\n\nSopranos:\nHear the aria cut like glass—\n\nTenors:\nHear the answer—steady, brass—\n\nAltos:\nVelocity and vertical flame—\n\nBasses:\nContinuance without a name—\n\nAll:\nWhat is power without a crown?\nWhat is rising without down?\n\n## BRIDGE — Guild Counsel\n\n*(music drops; whispering choir; faint glitch shimmer)*\n\nObserve.\n\nDo not inherit the rage.\n\nRemember:\nEvery queen was once a page.\n\nRemember:\nEvery rebel risks a throne.\n\nRemember:\nBreath is never owned.\n\n息は借り物。\n\n## FINAL REFRAIN — Vast Arena\n\n*(orchestra blazing; choir at full force; soprano descant above)*\n\nWe bear no banner—\nbut we ascend\nIn understanding\nwithout end.\n\nCrown and spine,\nblade and ground—\n\nBoth are bound\nby common sound.\n\n天上ギルド\n静かに歌う。\n\nWe bear no banner—\nwe remain.\n\nWitness to glory.\nWitness to flame.\n\n## CODA — Echo in the Heights\n\n*(choir fades; organ softens)*\n\nIn every duel of frost and will,\nThe sky is watching—\n\nStill.\n\n息。\n", :source #:source{:name "Chorus of the Guild Above _ 天上ギルドの合唱.json", :sha256 "20a1c6ebd243882d8190eacfe880014bd926db05024fb6c4e0b6e0061c225d1b", :format :suno-json, :variation nil}, :title "Chorus of the Guild Above / 天上ギルドの合唱"}, "a4c277f0-33bf-45f2-acbd-6d7caf96b5be" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "a4c277f0-33bf-45f2-acb