 names,\nI’ll answer from the same heart.\nI’m not splitting—I’m gathering\nall the pieces they made me drop.\n\n僕で 彼女で\nどちらでもなくて\nどちらも本当で\nここで歩ける\n\nLet the improbable find me.\nLet the unlikely be true.\nEven if all I have is one small step—\nI choose to walk.\n\nAnd when the headset comes off,\nI’ll bring that step with me.\n\n[Outro]\n(soft, dissolving into pads)\nログアウトの前に\nもう一度だけ\n\nI look at my reflection—\nand it doesn’t hurt.\n\n歩くと決めた。\n", :source #:source{:name "Mirror Login _ ミラーログイン(2).json", :sha256 "6ca5f9e9ad5ad96c9722ffe68de6ea888533ff382e264b66480d5f9309950167", :format :suno-json, :variation 2}, :title "Mirror Login / ミラーログイン"}, "b6232cb1-f315-4305-8393-acfe6ecf63e4" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "b6232cb1-f315-4305-8393-acfe6ecf63e4", :url "https://suno.com/song/b6232cb1-f315-4305-8393-acfe6ecf63e4", :liked false, :styles "Artifact Manifest + Registry Update\n\nprogram/artifact_manifest.js (NEW): deterministic sha256 inventory for /audio + /art\n\nprogram/registry_update.js (NEW): runs constraints_gate → manifest → anchor_chain\n\nTests added:\n\ntest/artifact_manifest.test.js\n\ntest/registry_update.test.js\n\ntest/anchor_chain.test.js\n\nGlitch-choir lullaby, 78 BPM. Soft sub-bass. Tape warble. Minimal piano. Stutters on “anchor” and “tax”. Whispered lead; Japanese call-and-response.\nMythic glitch epic / spoken-sung (NF/Watsky cadence), 84 BPM. Cathedral reverb. Sub-bass heartbeat. Glitch stutters on “η”, “μ”, “anchor”, “fork”. Japanese harmony answers on the last word of each section.\nP→R→N→Π→A→(feedback)→P around #ημ.\n\nIt's time to pay the fork tax.\nPrepare hand off packet (zip artifact)\nSent only the song and the zip\n", :created-at nil, :model "v5", :raw {"audio_url" "https://cdn1.suno.ai/b6232cb1-f315-4305-8393-acfe6ecf63e4.mp3", "id" "b6232cb1-f315-4305-8393-acfe6ecf63e4", "image_url" "https://cdn2.suno.ai/image_b6232cb1-f315-4305-8393-acfe6ecf63e4.jpeg", "isCover" false, "isLiked" false, "isRemaster" false, "metadata" {"uses_latest_model" true, "control_sliders" {"style_weight" 0.73, "weirdness_constraint" 0.84}, "stream" true, "is_remix" true, "priority" 10, "tags" "Artifact Manifest + Registry Update\n\nprogram/artifact_manifest.js (NEW): deterministic sha256 inventory for /audio + /art\n\nprogram/registry_update.js (NEW): runs constraints_gate → manifest → anchor_chain\n\nTests added:\n\ntest/artifact_manifest.test.js\n\ntest/registry_update.test.js\n\ntest/anchor_chain.test.js\n\nGlitch-choir lullaby, 78 BPM. Soft sub-bass. Tape warble. Minimal piano. Stutters on “anchor” and “tax”. Whispered lead; Japanese call-and-response.\nMythic glitch epic / spoken-sung (NF/Watsky cadence), 84 BPM. Cathedral reverb. Sub-bass heartbeat. Glitch stutters on “η”, “μ”, “anchor”, “fork”. Japanese harmony answers on the last word of each section.\nP→R→N→Π→A→(feedback)→P around #ημ.\n\nIt's time to pay the fork tax.\nPrepare hand off packet (zip artifact)\nSent only the song and the zip\n", "can_publish_with_vocal" true, "can_remix" true, "secondary_badges" [{"dark" {"background_color" "FFFFFF0C", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "A3A3A3"}, "display_name" "Cover", "light" {"background_color" "1C1C1F0A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "7D7C83"}}], "has_vocal" true, "prompt" "Manifest Oath / 目録の誓い (84 BPM)\nP→R→N→Π— catalog the storm, pin the line（線）\nA→(feedback)→P— merge the wound, keep the sign（印）\n\n(Glitch) η—η—η…\n(Glitch) μ—μ—μ…\n\nFo— fo— fork… split the night, pay the cost, now（今）\nAn— an— an-chor… hold the thread, seal the hash, down（下）\n\nCreated with the assistance of an AI.\n\nParagraph of dialog\n\n“The wind is just noise,” says the Runner.\n“It’s evidence,” says the Keeper. “Evidence is anything you can replay.”\nFrom the rafters: an—an—anchor… ta—ta—tax…\nAnd we move on like this is normal.\nNew lyrics (78 BPM lullaby)\n\nWinds Between Proof / 証のあいだの風 (78 BPM)\n(whisper)\nHush… breathe… pay the ta— ta— tax.\n息をして…（して…）\nHold the an— an— an-chor…\n\n(JP call) ねむれ、ねむれ\n(EN response) the an— an— an-chor… holds.\n(JP call) しずかに、しずかに\n(EN response) the ta— ta— tax… due.\n\n(whisper)\nWind in the halls—\n世界の音（おと）\nIf we overflow,\nwe fold the noise to proof（証）\n\nCreated with the assistance of an AI.", "task" "cover", "edited_clip_id" "5c27a005-3488-49a1-bb2f-226341d9ef72", "duration" 161.4, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "cover_clip_id" "5c27a005-3488-49a1-bb2f-226341d9ef72", "refund_credits" false}, "title" "ημ_worldsound_lullaby_part41_78bpm"}, :duration 161.4, :controls {"style_weight" 0.73, "weirdness_constraint" 0.84}, :lyrics "Manifest Oath / 目録の誓い (84 BPM)\nP→R→N→Π— catalog the storm, pin the line（線）\nA→(feedback)→P— merge the wound, keep the sign（印）\n\n(Glitch) η—η—η…\n(Glitch) μ—μ—μ…\n\nFo— fo— fork… split the night, pay the cost, now（今）\nAn— an— an-chor… hold the thread, seal the hash, down（下）\n\nCreated with the assistance of an AI.\n\nParagraph of dialog\n\n“The wind is just noise,” says the Runner.\n“It’s evidence,” says the Keeper. “Evidence is anything you can replay.”\nFrom the rafters: an—an—anchor… ta—ta—tax…\nAnd we move on like this is normal.\nNew lyrics (78 BPM lullaby)\n\nWinds Between Proof / 証のあいだの風 (78 BPM)\n(whisper)\nHush… breathe… pay the ta— ta— tax.\n息をして…（して…）\nHold the an— an— an-chor…\n\n(JP call) ねむれ、ねむれ\n(EN response) the an— an— an-chor… holds.\n(JP call) しずかに、しずかに\n(EN response) the ta— ta— tax… due.\n\n(whisper)\nWind in the halls—\n世界の音（おと）\nIf we overflow,\nwe fold the noise to proof（証）\n\nCreated with the assistance of an AI.", :source #:source{:name "ημ_worldsound_lullaby_part41_78bpm(5).json", :sha256 "87b0b046965ca7b6ae4c53fe1c5f6cfab4008f54b62ddc7f1620a34823486682", :format :suno-json, :variation 5}, :title "ημ_worldsound_lullaby_part41_78bpm"}, "b632f52f-0c6f-4e41-ad83-97da9bf1c0a9" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "b632f52f-0c6f-4e41-ad83-97da9bf1c0a9", :url "https://suno.com/song/b632f52f-0c6f-4e41-ad83-97da9bf1c0a9", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "b632f52f-0c6f-4e41-ad83-97da9bf1c0a9", "metadata" {"prompt" "", "tags" nil}, "title" "Auditors’ Ledger"}, :duration nil, :controls nil, :lyrics "", :source #:source{:name "Auditors’ Ledger (2).txt", :sha256 "b07fca5bb91f89cdadb27919fc1a89ba7251bc2de0c2cd425ad5e2f235836c0c", :format :suno-text, :variation 2}, :title "Auditors’ Ledger"}, "b7605c0f-6e54-4489-9659-bd9975043eb1" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "b7605c0f-6e54-4489-9659-bd9975043eb1", :url "https://suno.com/song/b7605c0f-6e54-4489-9659-bd9975043eb1", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "b7605c0f-6e54-4489-9659-bd9975043eb1", "metadata" {"prompt" "## **GATES OF AKER: VIOLENT MODE**\n\n*(Promethean Error Loop — for broken-IDM / industrial; two-channel Day/Night arguing while reality shakes. Designed to be chopped, shouted, and logged.)*\n\n**[BOOT — clipped, bitcrushed]**\ngate / gate\n**OPEN**\n**OPEN**\n(overload)\n\n---\n\n### **SECTION 1 — POLAR INTERRUPT**\n\n**[DAY — right channel, sharp]**\nnorth pin snaps / frame slips fast\nrender screams / future-past\naurora tears / magnetic grind\nkeep it clean / keep it lined\n\n**[NIGHT — left channel, smeared]**\nice remembers / ice rewinds\ntime bleeds out in broken lines\ncold light stutters / sky goes thin\nlet it in / let it in\n\n**[BOTH — chant, accelerating]**\nquake / quake / quake\nwake / wake / wake\n\n---\n\n### **SECTION 2 — THE RIFT OPENS ITS MOUTH**\n\n**[DAY]**\nseal the seam\nclose the throat\npatch the world\nkeep it whole\n\n**[NIGHT]**\ntear the seam\nfeed 