iver sings my prayer\nOh, lift me up\nLet the real world disappear\n\n[Chorus]\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, set me free\nSpirit rise, open wide\nI was born to cross that line\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, stay with me\nWhen I close my eyes\nI can touch the sky\n\n[Verse 2]\nThere was a palace of rain\nBuilt in the palm of my hand\nWe danced with an old sea drum\nTill the stars could understand\nYour voice was a velvet wind\nThrough the shea tree leaves at dawn\nI wore a crown made of hope\nAnd the fear was almost gone\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nOh, take me there\nWhere the river sings my prayer\nOh, lift me up\nLet the real world disappear\n\n[Chorus]\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, set me free\nSpirit rise, open wide\nI was born to cross that line\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, stay with me\nWhen I close my eyes\nI can touch the sky\n\n[Bridge]\n[Breakdown]\nBaba, guide my steps\nMake my dreams come alive\nAncestors in the smoke\nSay, \"child, you will survive\"\nI see it, I see it\nThe hidden, the holy glow\nI feel it, I feel it\nWhere only brave hearts go\n\n[Final Chorus]\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, set me free\nSpirit rise, open wide\nI was born to cross that line\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, stay with me\nWhen I close my eyes\nI can touch the sky\n\n[Outro]\nOh-oh, I can touch the sky\nFantasy, fantasy\nOh-oh, I can touch the sky\nFantasy, stay with me", "tags" nil}, "title" "Sapphire Dreaming"}, :duration nil, :controls nil, :lyrics "[Verse 1]\nI saw the moon wear pearls\nOver the kola nut fire\nYou called my name in gold\nAnd the night climbed higher\nBare feet on sacred sand\nI followed that silver thread\nYour eyes were a hidden door\nTo the world I had in my head\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nOh, take me there\nWhere the river sings my prayer\nOh, lift me up\nLet the real world disappear\n\n[Chorus]\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, set me free\nSpirit rise, open wide\nI was born to cross that line\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, stay with me\nWhen I close my eyes\nI can touch the sky\n\n[Verse 2]\nThere was a palace of rain\nBuilt in the palm of my hand\nWe danced with an old sea drum\nTill the stars could understand\nYour voice was a velvet wind\nThrough the shea tree leaves at dawn\nI wore a crown made of hope\nAnd the fear was almost gone\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nOh, take me there\nWhere the river sings my prayer\nOh, lift me up\nLet the real world disappear\n\n[Chorus]\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, set me free\nSpirit rise, open wide\nI was born to cross that line\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, stay with me\nWhen I close my eyes\nI can touch the sky\n\n[Bridge]\n[Breakdown]\nBaba, guide my steps\nMake my dreams come alive\nAncestors in the smoke\nSay, \"child, you will survive\"\nI see it, I see it\nThe hidden, the holy glow\nI feel it, I feel it\nWhere only brave hearts go\n\n[Final Chorus]\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, set me free\nSpirit rise, open wide\nI was born to cross that line\nFantasy, carry me\nFantasy, stay with me\nWhen I close my eyes\nI can touch the sky\n\n[Outro]\nOh-oh, I can touch the sky\nFantasy, fantasy\nOh-oh, I can touch the sky\nFantasy, stay with me", :source #:source{:name "Sapphire Dreaming.txt", :sha256 "f1a980bcd17202a9bbd03fc9971e161804615ab5a2e17c743dab72b681a8fdb9", :format :suno-text, :variation nil}, :title "Sapphire Dreaming"}, "b809f78b-d6c4-4246-adc5-e9997b8f56fd" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "b809f78b-d6c4-4246-adc5-e9997b8f56fd", :url "https://suno.com/song/b809f78b-d6c4-4246-adc5-e9997b8f56fd", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "b809f78b-d6c4-4246-adc5-e9997b8f56fd", "metadata" {"prompt" "", "tags" nil}, "title" "Zipworld LOR"}, :duration nil, :controls nil, :lyrics "", :source #:source{:name "Zipworld LOR (2).txt", :sha256 "a99c7c0ca31fee7da950e8a81d50ec29a18dcb231f897bf68234213c18dceadb", :format :suno-text, :variation 2}, :title "Zipworld LOR"}, "b84e360a-eea7-45f2-b2fe-e517f5370e31" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "b84e360a-eea7-45f2-b2fe-e517f5370e31", :url "https://suno.com/s