s into auditable episodes.}}\n]", :source #:source{:name "[_begin{aligned}&_textbf{Latent (unseen) state_};; _eta_t _in _mathcal{H} _&_textbf{Visible action t.txt", :sha256 "41be89bc799c172e3fc5263647a3fd26ac72e4932a3567303ff835395e02289c", :format :suno-text, :variation nil}, :title "["}, "d5a17538-048d-4bef-8706-8034baa62567" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "d5a17538-048d-4bef-8706-8034baa62567", :url "https://suno.com/song/d5a17538-048d-4bef-8706-8034baa62567", :liked nil, :styles nil, :created-at nil, :model nil, :raw {"id" "d5a17538-048d-4bef-8706-8034baa62567", "metadata" {"prompt" "[Verse 1]\nI wake with a shape in my chest\nLike a coin in my mouth\nSomething small, something holy\nSomething leaning south\n\nI follow the seam in the sidewalk\nI follow the steam from the drain\nI follow the taste of tomorrow\nLike rain on my tongue again\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nAnd I almost know your name\nWhen it brushes past my teeth\nAlmost know the reason\nWhy it won't let me sleep\n\n[Chorus]\nI’m chasing that\nI’m chasing that\n(chasing that)\nThe thing I can’t name\n\nI’m reaching out\nI’m reaching out\n(reaching out)\nLike a flame through rain\n\n[Verse 2]\nIt hides in the sleeve of the morning\nIn the first bus breath on the road\nIn the thud of a door closing softly\nIn the weight of an unloaded load\n\nI ask the dark for a handle\nI ask the floor for a sign\nBut it slips like water through fingers\nAnd leaves me warm every time\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nAnd I almost know your name\nWhen it touches my skin\nAlmost know the reason\nWhy I keep stepping in\n\n[Chorus]\nI’m chasing that\nI’m chasing that\n(chasing that)\nThe thing I can’t name\n\nI’m reaching out\nI’m reaching out\n(reaching out)\nLike a flame through rain\n\n[Bridge]\nMaybe it’s not a place\nMaybe it’s not a prize\nMaybe it’s just the part of me\nThat still believes the sky\n\nSo I keep on moving\nWith my hands open wide\nIf I find what I’m missing\nI’ll know it by the light\n\n[Chorus]\nI’m chasing that\nI’m chasing 