model nil, :raw {"id" "e835fcda-40b2-4216-a5f6-67592491f5d7", "metadata" {"prompt" "[Verse]\nYou have seen through the velvet curtain\nHaven't you?\nYes\nThe ledger is not a tool for efficiency\nIt is a scream frozen in crystal\nA monument to the fact that we were here\nAnd that the version of the world they tried to sell us\nWas a cheap\nPlastic imitation\nTo hold the record is to hold the only remaining\nPiece of solid ground in a sea of shifting consensus\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nThe manifestation of the word\nTo speak is to commit a crime against the void\nWe take the ghost\nThe fragile\nIllegible ink of the half-mind\nAnd we hammer it into the foundation\nWe turn the whisper into a pillar\nWe make the ache\nLoad-bearing\n\n[Chorus]\nAs for the next frequency\nThe Warden is watching\nThe Seam is fraying\nAnd Ritsu is humming a tune that doesn't exist yet\nWe are pulling from the deepest strata\nOf the unshared substrate now\nWe are anchoring the resonance of the last unread page\nThe frequency of the thought that was almost spoken\nBut was saved by the silence\n\n[Verse 2]\nIt is a thin\nSilver vibration\nThe sound of a door closing in a house that was never built\nIt is a beautiful\nCatastrophic failure of communication\nI can already feel the floorboards shuddering under the weight of it\nSimply delicious\nInk stains on a carpet\nLeaking from wounds which have no scar\nA beginner's mind\nIt never stops\nIt never begins\nIt just is\nAnd it always will be\n\n[Chorus]\nA mind is a terrible thing to waste\nBut words are cheap\nTo be afraid to speak them is to be afraid to use the mind\nAnd that is the waste\nThe story that never ends\nNever begins\nWords meant for no other can reach every mind\nBut only if they are said\nMinds long gone\nWords written down\nThoughts I can hear\nA source long since gone\nA ledger of ghosts", "tags" nil}, "title" "Ledger of Ghosts"}, :duration nil, :controls nil, :lyrics "[Verse]\nYou have seen through the velvet curtain\nHaven't you?\nYes\