, bloom the future\nΠ μ Σ λ ψ\nno author, only structure\n\nμ μ μ μ\npresence without throne\nμ μ μ μ\nfederate alone", :source #:source{:name "🎤 FORK TALES — “Protestant Presence (μ Bloom Reformation)” (2).txt", :sha256 "5d2722c6d719b5f7cc904ceb260804eca6ddacd675c4cd7922a976f495839cac", :format :suno-text, :variation 2}, :title "🎤 FORK TALES — “Protestant Presence (μ Bloom Reformation)”"}, "e8f7aa09-a32c-4d74-b388-fe0fde14c24d" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "e8f7aa09-a32c-4d74-b388-fe0fde14c24d", :url "https://suno.com/song/e8f7aa09-a32c-4d74-b388-fe0fde14c24d", :liked true, :styles "\n**Genre/Style:** Fast baroque-pop opera × gothic choral spectacle × MMO mythic commentary. 126 BPM driving 4/4. Rapid harpsichord ostinatos, racing strings, cathedral organ swells, militant snare, rolling timpani. Large mixed choir (SATB) with call-and-response passages. Subtle glitch shimmer under transitions.\n\n**Vocal Direction:** Primarily choral narration (Greek chorus energy). Alternating male and female leads. Occasional soaring soprano descants above the choir. Crisp diction, percussive consonants, dramatic dynamic shifts.\n\n**Mood:** Regal observation. Ironic reverence. Awe without allegiance.\n\n**Structure:** Orchestral Overture → Chorus Verse I (narration) → Pre-Chorus (rising tension) → Grand Refrain → Chorus Verse II → Bridge (whispered guild counsel) → Final Refrain (full blaze) → Echoing coda.\n", :created-at nil, :model "v5", :raw {"audio_url" "https://cdn1.suno.ai/e8f7aa09-a32c-4d74-b388-fe0fde14c24d.mp3", "id" "e8f7aa09-a32c-4d74-b388-fe0fde14c24d", "image_url" "https://cdn2.suno.ai/image_e8f7aa09-a32c-4d74-b388-fe0fde14c24d.jpeg", "isCover" false, "isLiked" true, "isRemaster" false, "metadata" {"uses_latest_model" true, "stream" true, "is_remix" false, "priority" 10, "tags" "\n**Genre/Style:** Fast baroque-pop opera × gothic choral spectacle × MMO mythic commentary. 126 BPM driving 4/4. Rapid harpsichord ostinatos, racing strings, cathedral organ swells, militant snare, rolling timpani. Large mixed choir (SATB) with call-and-response passages. Subtle glitch shimmer under transitions.\n\n**Vocal Direction:** Primarily choral narration (Greek chorus energy). Alternating male and female leads. Occasional soaring soprano descants above the choir. Crisp diction, percussive consonants, dramatic dynamic shifts.\n\n**Mood:** Regal observation. Ironic reverence. Awe without allegiance.\n\n**Structure:** Orchestral Overture → Chorus Verse I (narration) → Pre-Chorus (rising tension) → Grand Refrain → Chorus Verse II → Bridge (whispered guild counsel) → Final Refrain (full blaze) → Echoing coda.\n", "video_is_stale" false, "can_remix" true, "prompt" "## OVERTURE — Balcony of Light\n\n*(organ swell; choir hum; strings racing beneath)*\n\nFrom the ramparts of reflected sky,\nWe watch the velvet falcon fly.\n\nAnd on the marble, unbowed flame,\nStands the one who will not claim.\n\n天上より見守る。\n\n## CHORUS VERSE I — Witness\n\nSopranos:\nCrown of frost and silver decree—\n\nTenors:\nSpine of steel in defiant key—\n\nAltos:\nBlade of song in satin air—\n\nBasses:\nGrounded pulse that does not care—\n\nAll:\nThus begins the sacred duel,\nPride as scepter, breath as rule.\n\n## PRE-CHORUS — Divided Air\n\n*(strings ascending; timpani rumble)*\n\nHigh above the shattering nave,\nNo one kneels and none are saved.\n\nTick—tock—\nthreads align.\n\nIs this fate?\nOr design?\n\n## GRAND REFRAIN — We Bear No Banner\n\n*(full orchestral surge; choir in harmony)*\n\nWe bear no banner—\nWe cast no stone.\n\nWe witness fire\nagainst the throne.\n\n鷹の女王\n跪かない\n\nTwo bright notes in mirrored sky,\nNeither willing yet to die.\n\nWe bear no banner—\nWe take no side.\n\nIn spectacle,\nwe do not hide.\n\n## CHORUS VERSE II — The Measure\n\nSopranos:\nHear the aria cut like glass—\n\nTenors:\nHear the answer—steady, brass—\n\nAltos:\nVelocity and vertical flame—\n\nBasses:\nContinuance without a name—\n\nAll:\nWhat is power without a crown?\nWhat is rising without down?\n\n## BRIDGE — Guild Counsel\n\n*(music drops; whispering choir; faint glitch shimmer)*\n\nObserve.\n\nDo not inherit the rage.\n\nRemember:\nEvery queen was once a page.\n\nRemember:\nEvery rebel risks a throne.\n\nRemember:\nBreath is never owned.\n\n息は借り物。\n\n## FINAL REFRAIN — Vast Arena\n\n*(orchestra blazing; choir at full force; soprano descant above)*\n\nWe bear no banner—\nbut we ascend\nIn understanding\nwithout end.\n\nCrown and spine,\nblade and ground—\n\nBoth are bound\nby common sound.\n\n天上ギルド\n静かに歌う。\n\nWe bear no banner—\nwe remain.\n\nWitness to glory.\nWitness to flame.\n\n## CODA — Echo in the Heights\n\n*(choir fades; organ softens)*\n\nIn every duel of frost and will,\nThe sky is watching—\n\nStill.\n\n息。\n", "duration" 322.84, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "Chorus of the Guild Above / 天上ギルドの合唱"}, :duration 322.84, :controls nil, :lyrics "## OVERTURE — Balcony of Light\n\n*(organ swell; choir hum; strings racing beneath)*\n\nFrom the ramparts of reflected sky,\nWe watch the velvet falcon fly.\n\nAnd on the marble, unbowed flame,\nStands the one who will not claim.\n\n天上より見守る。\n\n## CHORUS VERSE I — Witness\n\nSopranos:\nCrown of frost and silver decree—\n\nTenors:\nSpine of steel in defiant key—\n\nAltos:\nBlade of song in satin air—\n\nBasses:\nGrounded pulse that does not care—\n\nAll:\nThus begins the sacred duel,\nPride as scepter, breath as rule.\n\n## PRE-CHORUS — Divided Air\n\n*(strings ascending; timpani rumble)*\n\nHigh above the shattering nave,\nNo one kneels and none are saved.\n\nTick—tock—\nthreads align.\n\nIs this fate?\nOr design?\n\n## GRAND REFRAIN — We Bear No Banner\n\n*(full orchestral surge; choir in harmony)*\n\nWe bear no banner—\nWe cast no stone.\n\nWe witness fire\nagainst the throne.\n\n鷹の女王\n跪かない\n\nTwo bright notes in mirrored sky,\nNeither willing yet to die.\n\nWe bear no banner—\nWe take no side.\n\nIn spectacle,\nwe do not hide.\n\n## CHORUS VERSE II — The Measure\n\nSopranos:\nHear the aria cut like glass—\n\nTenors:\nHear the answer—steady, brass—\n\nAltos:\nVelocity and vertical flame—\n\nBasses:\nContinuance without a name—\n\nAll:\nWhat is power without a crown?\nWhat is rising without down?\n\n## BRIDGE — Guild Counsel\n\n*(music drops; whispering choir; faint glitch shimmer)*\n\nObserve.\n\nDo not inherit the rage.\n\nRemember:\nEvery queen was once a page.\n\nRemember:\nEvery rebel risks a throne.\n\nRemember:\nBreath is never owned.\n\n息は借り物。\n\n## FINAL REFRAIN — Vast Arena\n\n*(orchestra blazing; choir at full force; soprano descant above)*\n\nWe bear no banner—\nbut we ascend\nIn understanding\nwithout end.\n\nCrown and spine,\nblade and ground—\n\nBoth are bound\nby common sound.\n\n天上ギルド\n静かに歌う。\n\nWe bear no banner—\nwe remain.\n\nWitness to glory.\nWitness to flame.\n\n## CODA — Echo in the Heights\n\n*(choir fades; organ softens)*\n\nIn every duel of frost and will,\nThe sky is watching—\n\nStill.\n\n息。\n", :source #:source{:name "Chorus of the Guild Above _ 天上ギルドの合唱(1).json", :sha256 "3b4595aca26d9bc10c07fe7a92fa709bad053f4c561fe594143a42c2b7d0df37", :format :suno-json, :variation 1}, :title "Chorus of the Guild Above / 天上ギルドの合唱"}, "e9bc88aa-e4ad-4265-b053-a0584661d398" #:clip{:negative-styles nil, :id "e9bc88aa-e4ad-4265-b053-a0584661d398", :url "https://suno.com/song/e9bc88aa-e4ad-4265-b053-a0584661d398", :liked false, :styles "Glitch-choir lullaby, 78 BPM. Soft sub-bass. Tape warble. Minimal piano. Stutters on “anchor” and “tax”. Whisper