\n\n### What this adds (all inside the zip)\n\n**Dense intent artifacts (Gates of Truth)**\n\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_events.bin`\n  **16 bytes / intent event** (fixed-width, streamable)\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_events.jsonl` (debuggable mirror)\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_anchors.jsonl` (**S3 anchors for every intent event**)\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_timeline.csv` (per-chapter intent energy)\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/entities_index.json` (entity IDs + intent type codes + binary schema)\n\n**Tools**\n\n* `operation-mindfuck/tools/analyze_gates_of_truth_intent_dense.py` (regenerates all the above)\n* `operation-mindfuck/tools/intent_codec.py` (decode/inspect the binary)\n* `operation-mindfuck/tools/build_box.py` (**updated**: adds `--run-gates-intent`)\n\n**Process**\n\n* `operation-mindfuck/process/intent_compression_spec.md` (binary layout + audit rule)\n\n### Why this matches your constraint\n\n* **Compression:** fixed **16 bytes/event** in `intent_events.bin`\n* **Anti-lie:** every intent record has an **S3 anchor** line (`intent_anchors.jsonl`)\n* **Fork discipline:** intent events become the *eligible fuel* for fork scoring (you can gate forks on strength thresholds cleanly)\n\n### Quick verify\n\n```bash\npython operation-mindfuck/tools/analyze_gates_of_truth_intent_dense.py \\\n  --input-zip Gates_of_Truth_Production_Bundle_v1.zip \\\n  --out operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense\n\npython operation-mindfuck/tools/intent_codec.py \\\n  --bin operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_events.bin \\\n  --index operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/entities_index.json \\\n  --limit 20\n```\n\n## Files written\n\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/*` (dense intent + anchors + timeline)\n* `operation-mindfuck/tools/analyze_gates_of_truth_intent_dense.py`\n* `operation-mindfuck/tools/intent_codec.py`\n* `operation-mindfuck/tools/build_box.py` (additive flag)\n* `operation-mindfuck/process/intent_compression_spec.md`\n\n## Why this is safe\n\nAdditive + versioned: it doesn’t overwrite your story corpus, only adds a new analysis lane (`gates_of_truth_intent_dense`) and a new optional build flag.\n\n## Frames\n\n1. **Intent as signal compression:** keep it dense enough to stream through cephalon loops.\n2. **Intent as fork fuel:** forks only happen where intent-energy crosses gates.\n3. **Intent as audit object:** binary for speed; anchors for truth.\n\n## Countermoves\n\n* If an intent event can’t be anchored → treat it as **invalid output** (drop it / fail build next pass).\n* If intent feels “over-saturated” (too many 255s) → adjust the strength curve in the analyzer (still stays 0..255).\n\n## Next\n\nRun your normal build with intent enabled:\n\n```bash\npython operation-mindfuck/tools/build_box.py --root operation-mindfuck --outdir dist --max-zip-mb 90 \\\n  --gates-zip Gates_of_Truth_Production_Bundle_v1.zip --run-gates-intent\n```", "tags" nil}, "title" "## Signal"}, :duration nil, :controls nil, :lyrics "## Signal\n\nIntent is now **compressed densely** and **auditable**.\n\n**New add-on part (saved to the box):**\n[Download Operation_Mindfuck_Box_part10_intent_dense_compression.zip](sandbox:/mnt/data/Operation_Mindfuck_Box_part10_intent_dense_compression.zip)\n\n### What this adds (all inside the zip)\n\n**Dense intent artifacts (Gates of Truth)**\n\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_events.bin`\n  **16 bytes / intent event** (fixed-width, streamable)\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_events.jsonl` (debuggable mirror)\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_truth_intent_dense/intent_anchors.jsonl` (**S3 anchors for every intent event**)\n* `operation-mindfuck/analysis/gates_of_tru