en — cut\nい — き — て — る\n\nwhite noise sparks\nmetallic wings\n\nsub bass rolls like distant thunder\nunder the spine\n\n---\n\n## VERSE 2 — Grunge Noise Bloom\n\nGuitar feedback like neon rain\n錆びた柱に触れる\nmy fingerprints glow\n\nPain is calibration\nnot punishment\n\nI press my palm to cold concrete\nand feel the building breathe.\n\n---\n\n## BRIDGE — Deconstructed Silence\n\n(beat drops out — vent hum only)\n\nListen.\n\nこの沈黙は空っぽじゃない\nit’s loaded.\n\nThe body is architecture.\nThe breath is wiring.\nThe rhythm is survival.\n\n---\n\n## FINAL CHORUS — Expanded Choir / Collapse-Resistant\n\n真夜中の倉庫で\nwe light the nerve again\n\nChoir of static\nchoir of steel\n\nBreak me open\nbut don’t erase me\n\nC minor shadows\nF minor bloom\nchromatic sparks under skin\n\nMidnight warehouse ritual\nstill here\nstill breathing\n\n---\n\n## OUTRO — Silence Pocket\n\n息。\n\nVent hum fades.\n\nConcrete cool.\n\nNo cathedral.\nNo country.\n\nJust pulse.\n", "duration" 475.12, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "00000000", "border_color" "FFFFFF1A", "text_color" "A3A3A3"}, "display_name" "v4.5-all", "light" {"background_color" "00000000", "border_color" "0000001A", "text_color" "7D7C83"}}}, "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "Cathedral Nervous System / 神経の聖堂"}, :duration 475.12, :controls nil, :lyrics "# TITLE: \"Midnight Warehouse Ritual / 真夜中の倉庫儀式\"\n\n---\n\n## STYLE PROMPT\n\n**Genre Fusion:** Post-Industrial Pressure Music × Ritual Glitch Rock × Breath-Guided IDM × Grunge Noise-Ambient × Deconstructed Club Architecture × Somatic Monologue Pop\n\n**Tuning / Tempo:** 432Hz, 88–100 BPM with micro-tempo instability (subtle drift ±2 BPM)\n\n**Key Center:** C minor drifting toward F modal minor, frequent chromatic intrusion (Db, Gb, E natural for tension)\n\n**Rhythmic Architecture:**\n\n* Kick like distant machinery (low, rounded, chest-heavy)\n* Snare as metal impact / warehouse reverb slap\n* Asymmetrical bre