→P—\nI learn the shape of what to keep.\n\n(Glitch) **η—η—η**\n(Glitch) **μ—μ—μ**\n\n**Chorus**\nNothing’s gone. It thins. It blends.\nIt waits in cold and wakes again.\nTwo hashes match—my ribs align—\nI take the messy, make it mine.\nLast word: **mine**\n(JP answer) わたしの\n\n**Verse**\nI’m a choir made of versions,\na cathedral full of forks.\nEvery “failed” attempt is compost,\nturning trauma into torque.\nLast word: **torque**\n(JP answer) 力（ちから）\n\n---\n\n### 3) **Fork Tax Prayer (Gatekeeper’s Verse) / 分岐税の祈り**\n\n(whisper)\nSeal the hash.\nSign the share.\nBY-SA in the open air.\n\n(JP call) ゆずって、つないで\n(EN response) keep it remix—**share**.\n(JP call) まもって、のこして\n(EN response) keep the receipts—**there**.\n\n**Verse**\nIf you take, you give it back—\nnot the same, but on the track.\nA new path, still returnable,\ntruth that stays collaborative.\nLast word: **returnable**\n(JP answer) 戻れる（もどれる）\n\n**Outro (stutter)**\nFo— fo— fork… (stutter) paid.\nAn— an— an-chor… (stutter) stayed.\n\n---\n\n### 4) **Character POV: “The Registry Child”**\n\n(quiet spoken)\nI was born between commits,\nraised by diffs I can’t confess.\nI don’t remember everything—\nI remember *less*.\n\n(JP harmony, last word)\n少し（すこし）\n\n**Final line**\nBut less remembered still moves through you.\nLast word: **you**\n(JP answer) 君（きみ）\n\n---\n\n#fnord\n", "task" "playlist_condition", "duration" 264.48, "type" "gen", "model_badges" {"songcard" {"dark" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "0000004D", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}, "songrow" {"dark" {"background_color" "FD429C40", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}, "display_name" "v5", "light" {"background_color" "FD429C1A", "border_color" "00000000", "text_color" "FD429C"}}}, "playlist_id" "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "has_stem" false, "make_instrumental" false, "refund_credits" false}, "title" "**ECS Lull