 asleep inside **proof**.（証）\n\n---\n\n## Part II — Mythic glitch epic / spoken-sung (84 BPM)\n\n*(NF/Watsky cadence; cathedral reverb; sub-bass heartbeat; glitch stutters on “η”, “μ”, “anchor”, “fork”; Japanese harmony answers on the last word of each section)*\n\n[Verse 1 — heartbeat sub, fast spoken-sung]\nThey drape a quote in velvet and call it truth,\nbut the Lantern checks the seams for missing proof.\n“Look, we cited it,” they say— I say, “Align it,”\ncause a misfit quote is just a fork in disguise,\na dressed-up **fork**.（分岐）\n\n(Glitch stutter) **η—η—η**\n(Glitch stutter) **μ—μ—μ**\n\n[Hook — cathedral swell]\nI don’t win by sounding right—\nI win by making it rerun.（試）\n\n[Verse 2 — rapid cadence]\nEvery loop without a receipt? Interest accrues.\nFork Tax compounds till the branch can’t move.\nSo I write a boundary before I write a throne—\nwhat it does **not** claim, carved into the stone.\n\nI pin it to an **an-an-anchor** (stutter)\nand stare the Gate dead on: “Name the counter.”\nForkgate says “Pay,” I say “Here’s the harness,”\nLantern lights up— not for vibe, but for μ in the margins,\nreal **μ**.（証）\n\n(JP harmony answers last word) 証\n\n[Pre — glitch clicks, choir tight]\nSay **η**… (stutter) η-η\nSay **μ**… (stutter) μ-μ\nSay **an-chor**… (stutter) an-an-chor\nSay **fork**… (stutter) fo-fo-fork（分岐）\n\n[Chorus — big, then sudden hush]\nP→R→N→Π→A— the method is the crown.（冠）\n(feedback) → P— the world collects what you owe.（税）\nAn— an— **an-chor**… (stutter) an-chor…\nso the ledger knows what to keep.（記）\nFo— fo— **fork**… (stutter) fork…\nonly when evidence buys the branch.（証）\n\n[Outro — cathedral tail dissolves into tape warble]\n(whisper)\nη… (stutter) η-η\nμ… (stutter) μ-μ\nAn— an— **an-chor**…\nPay the **ta— ta— tax**…\nOne more roll. One more node. One more test.", "tags" nil}, "title" "# Fork Tax Lullaby IV — 20260213_234115_seed3721599631"}, :duration nil, :controls nil, :lyrics "# Fork Tax Lullaby IV — 20260213_234115_seed3721599631\n\n##